{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01FnumAaBR9wHHdDAzc4oWXT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Universality claim scoped 为 'K*=2 is a robust discrimination boundary under standard\n  conditions (≥256 tokens; standard decoding; self-scorer or same-family scorer)'。\n  两个新模型族中 LLaMA 确认 K*=2 但边缘，Mistral 1v2 AUC 落入 0.58-0.60 灰区，论文中定位为\n  architecture-specific information loss rate boundary case 而非 counterexample——\n  Mistral 的 sliding window attention 引入非标准 context truncation，\n  DPI 框架预测此类 architecture 的 K*_theory 可能仍为 2 但 K*_empirical 因 feature\n  sensitivity 不足而降至 1。Pythia decoding ablation 3/4 确认 K*=2，\n  T=0.7 配置为边缘案例（CI lower ~0.598），分析为低温解码压缩 token diversity 导致\n  15D 特征的信息量降低。128-token 长度条件 K*=1 是 DPI 预测的 principled failure——\n  短文本互信息不足以支撑 depth>1 的区分。Cross-scorer matrix 重现 exp_A 的\n  scorer-dependence 模式但可控（~75% cells K*=2），论文增加 'Boundary conditions\n  of universality' 分析段落。C1' 降为 'K*=2 is a robust discrimination boundary\n  under standard conditions'。仍冲 EMNLP Main，rebuttal 策略：承认 scope +\n  强调已覆盖条件一致性 + DPI 理论预测泛化合理性。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  - name: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B cross-family depth chain\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-018\"\n    description: >\n      LLaMA-3.1-8B continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5,\n      scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。新模型族中的「确认方」——K*=2 成立但 CI lower 边缘。\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9712\n        1v2: 0.6163\n        2v3: 0.5538\n        3v4: 0.5247\n        4v5: 0.5103\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0028\n        1v2: 0.0089\n        2v3: 0.0061\n        3v4: 0.0095\n        4v5: 0.0072\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1: {auc: 0.9712, ci_lower: 0.9681, ci_upper: 0.9741, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        1v2: {auc: 0.6163, ci_lower: 0.6058, ci_upper: 0.6268, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {auc: 0.5538, ci_lower: 0.5432, ci_upper: 0.5644, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        3v4: {auc: 0.5247, ci_lower: 0.5142, ci_upper: 0.5352, perm_p: 0.0003}\n        4v5: {auc: 0.5103, ci_lower: 0.4998, ci_upper: 0.5208, perm_p: 0.0812}\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.11483\n        1v2: 0.00926\n        2v3: 0.00487\n        3v4: 0.00412\n        4v5: 0.00338\n      ordinal_mae: 1.198\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3491\n      top_features: [surp_d1_std, freq_entropy, surp_std, surp_mean, surp_d1_skew]\n      bootstrap_resamples: 10000\n      permutation_resamples: 10000\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLaMA-3.1-8B 是 Meta 的 Transformer 架构，与已验证的 Pythia/OLMo（GPT-2 style）\n      和 Qwen（Alibaba）形成第三个独立架构族。8B 规模下，cross-scorer（Qwen-1.5B 计算\n      surprisal features）引入约 2-3pp 的信号衰减（对比 exp-004 的 Qwen-7B self-scored\n      1v2=0.6178）。LLaMA 的 GQA attention 和 RoPE 编码使其 generation 分布与 Qwen 的\n      差异大于 Pythia/OLMo 之间的差异，但 depth degradation 的核心模式（surprisal\n      variance 增加、diversity 压缩）仍足以被 15D features 捕获。1v2 CI lower=0.6058\n      高于 θ=0.60 约 0.6pp——边缘但 pass。0v1 AUC 从其他模型的 0.97-0.99 降至 0.971，\n      因 cross-scorer surprisal 计算对 LLaMA tokenizer 不完全对齐，但 binary detection\n      仍然 robust。4v5 perm_p=0.08 不显著，与 exp-004 的 4v5 p=0.0676 一致——\n      深层代际区分力确实消失。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B Pairwise AUC with Bootstrap CI\"\n        columns: [depth_pair, auc, ci_lower, ci_upper, perm_p, \"K* at θ=0.60\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0v1, 0.9712, 0.9681, 0.9741, 0.0001, \"—\"]\n          - [1v2, 0.6163, 0.6058, 0.6268, 0.0001, \"K*=2 ✅ (edge, +0.58pp)\"]\n          - [2v3, 0.5538, 0.5432, 0.5644, 0.0001, \"< θ\"]\n          - [3v4, 0.5247, 0.5142, 0.5352, 0.0003, \"< θ\"]\n          - [4v5, 0.5103, 0.4998, 0.5208, 0.0812, \"n.s.\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"AUC decay curve: LLaMA-8B 叠加在 existing 5 models 上。LLaMA 的 1v2 AUC 位于 OLMo(0.615) 和 Qwen-cont(0.611) 之间，延续 cross-scorer 条件下信号衰减的规律。Decay 曲线形状与其他模型一致——steep 0v1→1v2 drop，后续近似平坦。\"\n      - \"Cross-family comparison radar chart: 6 个模型在 5 个 depth pair 上的 AUC，LLaMA 的 profile 与 OLMo 最相似。\"\n    analysis: >\n      LLaMA-8B K*=2 确认 universality 扩展至第三个独立架构族和 8B 规模。CI lower\n      0.6058 的边缘性源于 cross-scorer 设置——Qwen-1.5B 的 surprisal 估计对 LLaMA\n      tokenization 的系统性偏差（LLaMA 使用 BPE 32K vocab vs Qwen 的 151K vocab，\n      subword 粒度差异导致 surprisal 统计量的 calibration 偏移）。若使用 self-scorer，\n      1v2 AUC 预计可达 0.63+。论文中定位为 C1'(a) 的关键扩展证据：K*=2 跨越\n      {GPT-2 style, Qwen, LLaMA} 三个主要开源架构族和 1B-8B 规模。\n\n  - name: \"Mistral-7B-v0.3 cross-family depth chain\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-019\"\n    description: >\n      Mistral-7B-v0.3 continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5,\n      scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。新模型族中的「边缘/失败方」——1v2 AUC 落入 0.58-0.60 灰区。\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 1\n      k_star_note: \"1v2 AUC > 0.58 but CI lower < 0.60; formally K*=1 under strict CI criterion\"\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9683\n        1v2: 0.5934\n        2v3: 0.5412\n        3v4: 0.5189\n        4v5: 0.5067\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0031\n        1v2: 0.0094\n        2v3: 0.0073\n        3v4: 0.0088\n        4v5: 0.0081\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1: {auc: 0.9683, ci_lower: 0.9649, ci_upper: 0.9715, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        1v2: {auc: 0.5934, ci_lower: 0.5828, ci_upper: 0.6040, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {auc: 0.5412, ci_lower: 0.5306, ci_upper: 0.5518, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        3v4: {auc: 0.5189, ci_lower: 0.5083, ci_upper: 0.5295, perm_p: 0.0018}\n        4v5: {auc: 0.5067, ci_lower: 0.4961, ci_upper: 0.5173, perm_p: 0.1543}\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.10892\n        1v2: 0.00753\n        2v3: 0.00421\n        3v4: 0.00356\n        4v5: 0.00301\n      ordinal_mae: 1.243\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3367\n      top_features: [surp_d1_std, surp_std, freq_entropy, surp_mean, surp_d1_mean]\n      bootstrap_resamples: 10000\n      permutation_resamples: 10000\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mistral-7B 的 sliding window attention (SWA, window=4096) 与标准 full attention\n      的关键区别：SWA 在长序列中截断远距离 dependency，使 continuation-mode 生成的文本\n      在局部 n-gram 层面保持更高的 coherence（因为 attention 只看近邻），但全局\n      discourse structure 的退化被部分掩盖。这导致 15D surprisal-based features 在\n      捕获 depth 信号时效率降低——surp_d1_std 和 surp_std 对 Mistral 生成文本的\n      discriminative power 比 full-attention 模型低约 1.5-2pp。1v2 AUC=0.5934，\n      point estimate 接近 θ=0.60 但 CI lower=0.5828 明确低于阈值。这不是\n      K*_theory=1 的证据——Mistral 的 binary detection（0v1=0.968）依然 strong，\n      说明 depth-1 vs depth-0 的信号存在且 robust。问题在于 depth-1 vs depth-2 的\n      incremental signal 被 SWA 的 local smoothing 效应压缩到 15D features 无法\n      在 θ=0.60 下可靠检测的水平。DPI 理论预测：K*_theory 仍为 2（信息论上\n      generation 1→2 的信息损失非零），但 K*_empirical 因 feature sensitivity\n      不足降至 1。Neural probe（如果测试）预计可恢复 K*=2。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Mistral-7B Pairwise AUC with Bootstrap CI\"\n        columns: [depth_pair, auc, ci_lower, ci_upper, perm_p, \"K* at θ=0.60\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0v1, 0.9683, 0.9649, 0.9715, 0.0001, \"—\"]\n          - [1v2, 0.5934, 0.5828, 0.6040, 0.0001, \"K*=1 ⚠️ (CI lower 0.583 < θ)\"]\n          - [2v3, 0.5412, 0.5306, 0.5518, 0.0001, \"< θ\"]\n          - [3v4, 0.5189, 0.5083, 0.5295, 0.0018, \"< θ\"]\n          - [4v5, 0.5067, 0.4961, 0.5173, 0.1543, \"n.s.\"]\n      - title: \"New Model Family Summary (exp-018 + exp-019)\"\n        columns: [model, scale, architecture, 1v2_auc, ci_lower, k_star, verdict]\n        rows:\n          - [LLaMA-3.1-8B, 8B, \"full attention + GQA + RoPE\", 0.6163, 0.6058, 2, \"confirmed (edge)\"]\n          - [Mistral-7B-v0.3, 7B, \"SWA + GQA + RoPE\", 0.5934, 0.5828, 1, \"boundary case\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Comparative AUC decay curves: Mistral 的 1v2 point 明显低于 LLaMA 和所有已验证模型。图中用虚线标注 θ=0.60 threshold，Mistral 的 1v2 error bar 跨越 threshold，是唯一一个 CI 跨 θ 的条件。\"\n      - \"Architecture comparison scatter: x=0v1 AUC, y=1v2 AUC。所有模型的 0v1 都 clustered 在 0.96-0.99，但 1v2 展开——Mistral 是 outlier。标注 SWA vs full attention 区分。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Mistral K*=1 是 median 档的核心 scoping event。论文中不应将其呈现为 universality\n      的 counterexample，而是 architecture-specific boundary condition。Narrative 策略：\n      (1) 承认 Mistral 在 15D features 下 K*=1；(2) 指出 0v1 AUC=0.968 证明 depth\n      signal 存在，问题在 feature sensitivity 而非 signal absence；(3) 用 SWA 的\n      local smoothing 给出 mechanistic 解释——attention window 截断导致 discourse-level\n      degradation 在 local statistics 中被平滑；(4) 指出 1v2 point estimate=0.593\n      距 θ 仅 0.7pp，neural probe 预计可恢复 K*=2。Discussion 中加入 'Boundary\n      conditions of universality' 段落，将 Mistral 与 128-token 长度条件并列为\n      principled boundary cases。C1' 措辞从 'universal across all tested conditions'\n      降为 'robust under standard conditions'，Mistral 和 128-token 作为 informative\n      scope delineation。\n\n  - name: \"Pythia-1.4B decoding strategy ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-020\"\n    description: >\n      Pythia-1.4B 四种解码策略（greedy / nucleus p=0.9 / T=0.7 / T=1.2），C4 5K docs,\n      depth 0-5。跨模型验证 exp-003 的解码策略不变性。3/4 确认 K*=2，T=0.7 边缘。\n    expected_results:\n      config1_greedy:\n        k_star: 2\n        pairwise_auc:\n          0v1: 0.9823\n          1v2: 0.6412\n          2v3: 0.5487\n          3v4: 0.5198\n          4v5: 0.5112\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9823, ci_lower: 0.9801, ci_upper: 0.9845, perm_p: 0.0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6412, ci_lower: 0.6308, ci_upper: 0.6516, perm_p: 0.0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5487, ci_lower: 0.5384, ci_upper: 0.5590, perm_p: 0.0}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5198, ci_lower: 0.5093, ci_upper: 0.5303, perm_p: 0.0004}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5112, ci_lower: 0.5007, ci_upper: 0.5217, perm_p: 0.0234}\n      config2_nuc09:\n        k_star: 2\n        pairwise_auc:\n          0v1: 0.9917\n          1v2: 0.6498\n          2v3: 0.5523\n          3v4: 0.5214\n          4v5: 0.5089\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9917, ci_lower: 0.9903, ci_upper: 0.9931, perm_p: 0.0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6498, ci_lower: 0.6395, ci_upper: 0.6601, perm_p: 0.0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5523, ci_lower: 0.5419, ci_upper: 0.5627, perm_p: 0.0}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5214, ci_lower: 0.5109, ci_upper: 0.5319, perm_p: 0.0002}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5089, ci_lower: 0.4984, ci_upper: 0.5194, perm_p: 0.0923}\n      config3_t07:\n        k_star: 2\n        k_star_note: \"borderline — CI lower 0.5983 barely misses θ=0.60; point estimate above θ\"\n        pairwise_auc:\n          0v1: 0.9854\n          1v2: 0.6103\n          2v3: 0.5456\n          3v4: 0.5167\n          4v5: 0.5098\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9854, ci_lower: 0.9834, ci_upper: 0.9874, perm_p: 0.0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6103, ci_lower: 0.5983, ci_upper: 0.6223, perm_p: 0.0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5456, ci_lower: 0.5348, ci_upper: 0.5564, perm_p: 0.0}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5167, ci_lower: 0.5058, ci_upper: 0.5276, perm_p: 0.0012}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5098, ci_lower: 0.4990, ci_upper: 0.5206, perm_p: 0.0567}\n      config4_t12:\n        k_star: 2\n        pairwise_auc:\n          0v1: 0.9961\n          1v2: 0.6673\n          2v3: 0.5568\n          3v4: 0.5231\n          4v5: 0.5154\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9961, ci_lower: 0.9951, ci_upper: 0.9970, perm_p: 0.0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6673, ci_lower: 0.6568, ci_upper: 0.6778, perm_p: 0.0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5568, ci_lower: 0.5462, ci_upper: 0.5674, perm_p: 0.0}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5231, ci_lower: 0.5122, ci_upper: 0.5340, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5154, ci_lower: 0.5047, ci_upper: 0.5261, perm_p: 0.0048}\n      method: \"GroupKFold(5) OOF + doc-level bootstrap (10K) + label permutation (10K)\"\n      kstar2_fraction: 0.75\n      kstar2_fraction_note: \"3/4 clear K*=2 by CI lower > θ; config3_t07 CI lower=0.5983 is 0.17pp below θ, point estimate K*=2\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Pythia-1.4B baseline (nucleus p=0.95) 1v2=0.6539 是所有 continuation 模型中\n      次高的。四种解码策略的预测逻辑：\n\n      **Greedy (1v2=0.641)**: deterministic decoding 消除 sampling variance 但保留\n      model's MAP estimate。Pythia 的 greedy output 比 nucleus 略更 repetitive\n      （self_BLEU 更高），导致 diversity features（ttr, hapax_ratio）的 depth signal\n      被压缩。Greedy AUC 比 nucleus 低约 1pp，与 Qwen 上的 pattern 一致\n      （Qwen greedy 0.6892 vs nucleus 0.6862, 差异更小因为 Qwen-rw mode 本身就\n      有 instruction-driven diversity）。\n\n      **Nucleus p=0.9 (1v2=0.650)**: 接近 baseline (p=0.95)，sampling distribution\n      略窄导致 top-p cutoff 处的 token selection 差异小。与 baseline 的差异在\n      noise 范围内。\n\n      **T=0.7 (1v2=0.610, EDGE)**: 低温解码是四种策略中最 problematic 的——\n      T=0.7 将 logit distribution 锐化，使 Pythia 在每步生成时都倾向高概率 token，\n      连续多代生成后 text diversity 的 baseline 被压得很低，导致 depth-1 和 depth-2\n      的 15D feature 分布差异被压缩。关键机制：低温使 surprisal distribution\n      更 peaked（surp_std 减小），而 surp_std 恰好是 top discriminative feature——\n      当 feature 本身的 variance 被压缩时，它区分不同 depth 的能力也随之下降。\n      CI lower=0.5983 距 θ 仅 -0.17pp，在统计意义上属于 「不可区分于 θ」 的范围。\n      论文中 Pythia T=0.7 和 Qwen-cont（CI lower=0.6015, +0.15pp）形成对称的\n      双端 edge cases。\n\n      **T=1.2 (1v2=0.667)**: 高温解码增加 token diversity，使 successive generations\n      的 diversity 压缩更显著，depth signal 被放大。与 exp-003 的 Qwen T=1.2\n      (0.7037) pattern 一致——高温是最有利于 depth discrimination 的解码配置。\n      Pythia T=1.2 的 1v2 比 baseline 高约 1.3pp，幅度略小于 Qwen（因 continuation\n      mode 的 signal amplification 弱于 rewrite）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Pythia-1.4B Decoding Ablation Summary\"\n        columns: [decoding, 1v2_auc, ci_lower, ci_upper, k_star, verdict]\n        rows:\n          - [greedy, 0.6412, 0.6308, 0.6516, 2, \"✅ clear\"]\n          - [\"nucleus p=0.9\", 0.6498, 0.6395, 0.6601, 2, \"✅ clear\"]\n          - [T=0.7, 0.6103, 0.5983, 0.6223, \"2*\", \"⚠️ CI lower < θ by 0.17pp\"]\n          - [T=1.2, 0.6673, 0.6568, 0.6778, 2, \"✅ clear\"]\n      - title: \"Cross-model Decoding Invariance Comparison (Qwen exp-003 vs Pythia exp-020)\"\n        columns: [decoding, \"Qwen-rw 1v2\", \"Pythia 1v2\", \"Δ\", \"both K*=2?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [greedy, 0.6892, 0.6412, -0.0480, \"✅ / ✅\"]\n          - [\"nucleus p=0.9\", 0.6862, 0.6498, -0.0364, \"✅ / ✅\"]\n          - [T=0.7, 0.6885, 0.6103, -0.0782, \"✅ / ⚠️ edge\"]\n          - [T=1.2, 0.7037, 0.6673, -0.0364, \"✅ / ✅\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Decoding strategy × model interaction heatmap: 8 cells (4 decoding × 2 models), 颜色编码 1v2 AUC。Pythia 行整体低于 Qwen 行约 4-8pp，但 pattern 一致：T=1.2 最高，T=0.7 最低。Pythia T=0.7 是唯一一个 AUC 接近 θ 的 cell。\"\n      - \"AUC vs temperature/sampling 参数散点图: x=decoding parameter (对 greedy 标为 'deterministic'), y=1v2 AUC, 两条线分别对应 Qwen 和 Pythia。两线近似平行但 Pythia 线整体下移。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Pythia decoding ablation 的核心发现是 K*=2 在 7/8 decoding×model 组合中 robust\n      （exp-003 4/4 + exp-020 3/4），唯一 edge case (Pythia T=0.7) 有清晰的\n      mechanistic 解释。T=0.7 的边缘性不是 random noise——它是 model-specific signal\n      strength 与 decoding-induced diversity compression 的 interaction。Pythia\n      的 baseline 1v2 AUC（0.654）比 Qwen-rw（0.696）低 4pp，这 4pp 的 margin\n      在 T=0.7 的 diversity compression 下被消耗殆尽。论文中可写：「K*=2 is invariant\n      to decoding strategy for both tested architectures, with a single borderline\n      case (Pythia, T=0.7) where low-temperature decoding compresses the already\n      moderate depth signal below the detection threshold. This is consistent with\n      the information-theoretic prediction that K*_empirical depends on the feature\n      set's sensitivity to the residual mutual information I(X_k; X_{k+1}).」\n\n  - name: \"Text length ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-021\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation, 128/256/512 tokens, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5。\n      验证 K* 对文本长度的敏感性。128-token 预期 K*=1（信息量不足），256/512 K*=2。\n    expected_results:\n      length_128:\n        k_star: 1\n        pairwise_auc:\n          0v1: 0.9847\n          1v2: 0.5912\n          2v3: 0.5389\n          3v4: 0.5194\n          4v5: 0.5078\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9847, ci_lower: 0.9823, ci_upper: 0.9871, perm_p: 0.0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.5912, ci_lower: 0.5793, ci_upper: 0.6031, perm_p: 0.0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5389, ci_lower: 0.5271, ci_upper: 0.5507, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5194, ci_lower: 0.5078, ci_upper: 0.5310, perm_p: 0.0039}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5078, ci_lower: 0.4963, ci_upper: 0.5193, perm_p: 0.1678}\n        ordinal_mae: 1.267\n        ordinal_accuracy: 0.3298\n      length_256:\n        k_star: 2\n        pairwise_auc:\n          0v1: 0.9942\n          1v2: 0.6187\n          2v3: 0.5562\n          3v4: 0.5341\n          4v5: 0.5118\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9942, ci_lower: 0.9930, ci_upper: 0.9954, perm_p: 0.0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6187, ci_lower: 0.6078, ci_upper: 0.6296, perm_p: 0.0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5562, ci_lower: 0.5454, ci_upper: 0.5670, perm_p: 0.0}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5341, ci_lower: 0.5234, ci_upper: 0.5448, perm_p: 0.0}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5118, ci_lower: 0.5011, ci_upper: 0.5225, perm_p: 0.0189}\n        ordinal_mae: 1.182\n        ordinal_accuracy: 0.3612\n      length_512:\n        k_star: 2\n        pairwise_auc:\n          0v1: 0.9969\n          1v2: 0.6134\n          2v3: 0.5598\n          3v4: 0.5387\n          4v5: 0.5132\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9969, ci_lower: 0.9960, ci_upper: 0.9977, perm_p: 0.0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6134, ci_lower: 0.6028, ci_upper: 0.6240, perm_p: 0.0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5598, ci_lower: 0.5492, ci_upper: 0.5704, perm_p: 0.0}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5387, ci_lower: 0.5280, ci_upper: 0.5494, perm_p: 0.0}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5132, ci_lower: 0.5026, ci_upper: 0.5238, perm_p: 0.0078}\n        ordinal_mae: 1.162\n        ordinal_accuracy: 0.3783\n      length_baseline_comparison:\n        qwen_cont_default: {1v2_auc: 0.6112, note: \"default length ~512+ tokens\"}\n        key_delta: \"128→256: +2.75pp 1v2 AUC; 256→512: -0.53pp (plateau)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      文本长度对 15D features 的影响通过两个机制：(1) 统计估计精度——n-gram 频率、\n      surprisal 统计量在短文本上的方差更大，导致 per-document features 更 noisy；\n      (2) 信息总量——DPI 约束下每一代信息损失是固定的 rate，但 15D features 只能\n      捕获 aggregate statistics，短文本的 aggregate 包含的有效信息更少。\n\n      **128 tokens (K*=1)**: 128 tokens ≈ 90-100 词，对于 surprisal 统计量（mean,\n      std, skewness, kurtosis）的估计不够稳定。surp_d1_std（top feature）需要计算\n      token-level surprisal 的一阶差分的标准差——128 tokens 只有 ~127 个一阶差分样本，\n      其中有效的（非 padding、非 BOS/EOS）约 120 个。这个样本量下 std 估计的\n      standard error ≈ σ/√(2n) ≈ 0.065σ，足以使不同 depth 的 surp_d1_std 分布\n      重叠度大幅增加。1v2 AUC=0.591 距 θ 仅 -0.9pp，CI 上界 0.603 跨越 θ——\n      说明 128 tokens 处于 information-sufficient 边界，不是完全无信号，而是信号\n      不足以 reliably 超过 θ。这完美符合 DPI 理论的预测：K*_theory 不依赖文本长度\n      （信息论极限与样本量无关），但 K*_empirical 依赖 feature 估计的质量，\n      短文本使 estimation noise 掩盖了 true depth signal。\n\n      **256 tokens (K*=2)**: 256 tokens 提供 ~250 个有效样本点，std 估计的\n      standard error 降至 0.045σ，feature 分布重叠度降低到足以支撑 1v2 区分。\n      1v2 AUC=0.619 与 Qwen-cont baseline (0.611) 接近，说明 256 tokens 已\n      接近信息饱和。\n\n      **512 tokens (K*=2)**: 512 tokens 的 1v2 AUC=0.613 与 256 tokens (0.619)\n      几乎无差异（Δ=-0.5pp, within noise）——confirming 信息饱和发生在 256 tokens\n      附近。这与 NLP 中 document-level statistics 的 convergence 行为一致——\n      most distributional statistics converge by n≈200-300 tokens。512→default\n      也无提升（default 0.611 vs 512 0.613），进一步确认 plateau。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Length Ablation Results\"\n        columns: [length, 0v1_auc, 1v2_auc, 1v2_ci_lower, k_star, \"information sufficiency\"]\n        rows:\n          - [128, 0.9847, 0.5912, 0.5793, 1, \"insufficient — below θ\"]\n          - [256, 0.9942, 0.6187, 0.6078, 2, \"sufficient — above θ\"]\n          - [512, 0.9969, 0.6134, 0.6028, 2, \"sufficient — plateau\"]\n          - [\"default (~512+)\", 0.9971, 0.6112, 0.6015, 2, \"reference (exp-017)\"]\n      - title: \"Feature Estimation Quality by Length\"\n        columns: [length, surp_std_stderr_ratio, effective_samples, feature_overlap_1v2]\n        rows:\n          - [128, 0.065, \"~120\", \"high (AUC→0.59)\"]\n          - [256, 0.045, \"~250\", \"moderate (AUC→0.62)\"]\n          - [512, 0.032, \"~500\", \"moderate (AUC→0.61)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"1v2 AUC vs text length 曲线: x=token length (128, 256, 512, default), y=1v2 AUC。曲线在 128→256 急剧上升 (+2.75pp)，256→512 平坦（-0.5pp within noise）。θ=0.60 水平虚线标注，128 落在下方。\"\n      - \"AUC decay curves 按 length 分组: 三条 AUC decay curves (128/256/512)，128 的 1v2 point 明显低于其他两条，但三条曲线在 2v3 以后几乎重合——说明 length 效应集中在 near-boundary discrimination。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Length ablation 提供了 K*_empirical 的 principled lower bound condition：当文本\n      长度不足以支撑 15D features 的稳定估计时，K*_empirical 降至 1。这不是 K*_theory\n      的变化，而是 measurement precision 的限制。论文中这一结果有三重价值：\n      (1) 为 C1' 的 scope 提供 principled boundary——'≥256 tokens' 成为 K*=2 的\n      先决条件之一，而非 ad hoc limitation；\n      (2) 信息饱和 plateau 在 ~256 tokens 处，给出 practical deployment guidance\n      （无需等待完整文档，256 tokens 足以进行 depth estimation）；\n      (3) 128-token 的 failure 与 Mistral 的 failure 形成 parallel——两者都是\n      feature sensitivity 不足导致 K*_empirical < K*_theory，加强了 'K*=2 is a\n      property of the data, K*_empirical is a property of the measurement' 的论述。\n\n  - name: \"4×4 Cross-scorer independence matrix\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-022\"\n    description: >\n      4 generators (Qwen-cont, Pythia, OLMo, Qwen-base) × 4 scorers (same models),\n      验证 scorer independence 完整性。重现 exp_A 的 scorer-dependence 模式但量化可控性。\n    expected_results:\n      kstar2_fraction: 0.75\n      kstar2_count: \"12/16\"\n      kstar_matrix:\n        Qwen_cont_gen:\n          Qwen_cont_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6112, k_star: 2, note: \"self-scorer reference\"}\n          Pythia_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.5978, k_star: 1, note: \"cross-family K*=1\"}\n          OLMo_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.5923, k_star: 1, note: \"cross-family K*=1\"}\n          Qwen_base_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6089, k_star: 2, note: \"same-family scorer, CI lower ~0.600\"}\n        Pythia_gen:\n          Qwen_cont_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.5931, k_star: 1, note: \"matches exp_A pattern\"}\n          Pythia_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6539, k_star: 2, note: \"self-scorer reference\"}\n          OLMo_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6387, k_star: 2, note: \"similar architecture\"}\n          Qwen_base_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6102, k_star: 2, note: \"cross-family but sufficient\"}\n        OLMo_gen:\n          Qwen_cont_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.5864, k_star: 1, note: \"matches exp_A pattern\"}\n          Pythia_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6298, k_star: 2, note: \"similar architecture\"}\n          OLMo_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6145, k_star: 2, note: \"self-scorer reference\"}\n          Qwen_base_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6031, k_star: 2, note: \"cross-family edge, CI lower ~0.602\"}\n        Qwen_base_gen:\n          Qwen_cont_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6223, k_star: 2, note: \"same-family scorer\"}\n          Pythia_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6078, k_star: 2, note: \"cross-family, just above θ\"}\n          OLMo_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6012, k_star: 2, note: \"cross-family edge\"}\n          Qwen_base_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6262, k_star: 2, note: \"self-scorer reference\"}\n      feature_rank_correlation:\n        mean_spearman_rho: 0.912\n        min_spearman_rho: 0.867\n        note: \"Feature importance ranking highly stable across all 16 scorer conditions (ρ ≥ 0.87)\"\n      k_star_1_cells: [\"Qwen-cont→Pythia-scorer\", \"Qwen-cont→OLMo-scorer\", \"Pythia→Qwen-cont-scorer\", \"OLMo→Qwen-cont-scorer\"]\n      k_star_1_pattern: \"K*=1 only occurs when Qwen-Instruct-cont is one endpoint (generator or scorer) and the other is Pythia/OLMo — same pattern as exp_A\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-scorer matrix 的核心 pattern 源于 surprisal feature 计算的 scorer-dependence：\n      15D features 中 6/15 是 surprisal-based（surp_mean, surp_std, surp_skew,\n      surp_d1_*, surp_d2_*），它们依赖 scorer model 的 tokenizer 和 language model\n      distribution。当 scorer 与 generator 来自不同架构族时：\n\n      **K*=1 cells (4/16)**: 全部涉及 Qwen-Instruct-cont 与 Pythia/OLMo 的交叉。\n      机制：Qwen 的 151K vocab tokenizer 与 Pythia/OLMo 的 50K vocab tokenizer\n      对同一文本产生不同的 subword 分割，导致 surprisal 统计量的 absolute values\n      和 distribution shape 系统性偏移。当 Qwen-cont 生成的文本被 Pythia 评分时，\n      Pythia 的 surprisal 分布反映的是 'Pythia 对 Qwen-style 文本的困惑度'，\n      而非 'depth 导致的 intrinsic quality degradation'。这个 confound 在 0v1\n      处不影响（human vs any-synthetic 的 surprisal gap 足够大），但在 1v2 处\n      将 depth signal 压缩到 θ 以下。\n\n      **K*=2 cells (12/16)**:\n      - Self-scorer (4): 无 confound，与已有结果一致。\n      - Same-family cross (Qwen-cont↔Qwen-base, 2 cells): 同架构不同 training，\n        tokenizer 相同，surprisal calibration 差异极小。\n      - Pythia↔OLMo cross (2 cells): 虽然是不同模型，但都继承自 GPT-2 style\n        架构，vocab size 接近（50257 vs 50304），tokenizer overlap 高，surprisal\n        统计量的 cross-model 偏移可控。\n      - Cross-family with Qwen-base as scorer for Pythia/OLMo (2 cells): Qwen-base\n        没有 instruction tuning 的 distribution shift，其 surprisal 估计对\n        continuation-mode 文本的 calibration 比 Qwen-Instruct 更好，1v2 AUC\n        勉强过线。\n      - Qwen-base gen scored by Pythia/OLMo (2 cells): Qwen-base 的 continuation\n        generation 产生的 text style 比 Qwen-Instruct 更 neutral，Pythia/OLMo\n        scorer 对其 depth signal 的捕获效率更高。\n\n      Feature ranking stability (mean ρ=0.91) 确认 exp_A 的发现：scorer choice\n      影响 absolute AUC 但不影响 which features matter。这意味着 scorer-dependence\n      是 calibration issue 而非 signal-type issue——depth degradation 的 feature\n      signature 是 scorer-independent 的，只是 magnitude 受 scorer-generator\n      alignment 调制。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"4×4 Cross-Scorer K* Matrix (1v2 AUC / K*)\"\n        columns: [\"Gen \\\\ Scorer\", Qwen-cont, Pythia, OLMo, Qwen-base]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen-cont\", \"0.611/K*=2\", \"0.598/K*=1\", \"0.592/K*=1\", \"0.609/K*=2\"]\n          - [\"Pythia\", \"0.593/K*=1\", \"0.654/K*=2\", \"0.639/K*=2\", \"0.610/K*=2\"]\n          - [\"OLMo\", \"0.586/K*=1\", \"0.630/K*=2\", \"0.615/K*=2\", \"0.603/K*=2\"]\n          - [\"Qwen-base\", \"0.622/K*=2\", \"0.608/K*=2\", \"0.601/K*=2\", \"0.626/K*=2\"]\n      - title: \"Scorer Independence: Feature Rank Correlation (Spearman ρ)\"\n        columns: [condition, rho, note]\n        rows:\n          - [\"self vs Pythia-scorer (avg)\", 0.923, \"high stability\"]\n          - [\"self vs OLMo-scorer (avg)\", 0.908, \"high stability\"]\n          - [\"self vs Qwen-base-scorer (avg)\", 0.941, \"highest (same tokenizer for Qwen-gen)\"]\n          - [\"cross-family min\", 0.867, \"Qwen-cont gen, OLMo scorer\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"K* matrix heatmap: 4×4 grid, 颜色编码 1v2 AUC (green >0.62, yellow 0.60-0.62, red <0.60)。Diagonal 全 green，cross-family cells 中 Qwen-Instruct-cont 相关的 4 个 cells 标红。清晰的 block-diagonal structure。\"\n      - \"Scorer impact scatter: 对每个 generator，4 个 scorer 条件的 1v2 AUC 用 jitter plot 展示。Pythia 和 OLMo 的 scatter 较窄（scorer 影响小），Qwen-cont 的 scatter 较宽（scorer 影响大）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-scorer matrix 确认 exp_A 的 scorer-dependence pattern 并完整量化其边界：\n      K*=1 严格限于 Qwen-Instruct-cont 与 Pythia/OLMo 的交叉配对（vocab mismatch +\n      instruction-tuning distribution shift 的叠加效应）。75% 的 cells K*=2 表明\n      scorer independence 在 majority conditions 下成立。论文中措辞：'K*=2 is\n      scorer-independent under same-family or similar-tokenizer conditions; cross-family\n      scoring with large tokenizer mismatch (50K vs 151K vocab) reduces K*_empirical\n      to 1, a calibration artifact rather than a signal absence.'\n\n      这一结果进一步 refine C1' 的 scope：universality claim 需额外条件 'with\n      matched or similar-family scorer'——这不是严重限制，因为实际部署中 scorer\n      selection 是可控参数。加入 Recommendation：'For cross-model depth estimation,\n      use a scorer from the same architecture family or with similar tokenizer;\n      alternatively, use the 9 non-surprisal features (frequency + diversity) for\n      fully scorer-independent estimation at the cost of ~2pp AUC reduction.'\n\n  - name: \"Retrain-chain ecological validity\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-008\"\n    description: >\n      Pythia-1.4B LoRA (rank=16, alpha=32), C4 5K docs, depth 0-4。对比 prompt-chain\n      和 retrain-chain 的 K* 和特征分布。P1 验证实验。\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9823\n        1v2: 0.6317\n        2v3: 0.5612\n        3v4: 0.5234\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0019\n        1v2: 0.0107\n        2v3: 0.0089\n        3v4: 0.0102\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        1v2: {ci_lower: 0.6198, ci_upper: 0.6436}\n        2v3: {ci_lower: 0.5503, ci_upper: 0.5721}\n      prompt_vs_retrain_comparison:\n        feature_kl_divergence: 0.147\n        degradation_ordering_spearman: 0.783\n        k_star_agreement: true\n        auc_1v2_delta: -0.0222\n        note: \"Retrain-chain 1v2 AUC lower than prompt-chain (0.632 vs 0.654) but K* identical\"\n      ordinal_mae: 1.127\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3734\n    result_rationale: >\n      Retrain-chain（真正的 model collapse pipeline）与 prompt-chain 的关键区别：\n      retrain-chain 中模型权重在每一代被更新，generation distribution 的变化\n      包含 weight drift + data distribution shift 两个因素，而 prompt-chain 只有\n      后者。在 median 档下：\n\n      K*=2 保持——两种 chain 类型的 depth-1 vs depth-2 区分都是 robust 的，因为\n      第一次 retrain 导致的 distributional shift 仍然足够大。但 1v2 AUC 比\n      prompt-chain 低约 2pp (0.632 vs 0.654)：retrain-chain 的 LoRA fine-tuning\n      使模型逐渐 adapt 到 synthetic data distribution，部分 compensate 了\n      quality degradation，导致 depth signal 被轻微压缩。\n\n      Feature distribution 差异（KL=0.147）主要来自 freq_entropy 和 ttr——\n      retrain-chain 中模型学会了 synthetic text 的 vocabulary usage pattern，\n      导致 diversity metrics 的 depth-dependent degradation 幅度减小。\n      但 surprisal-based features 受影响较小（因为 scorer 是 fixed Pythia-1.4B，\n      不是 retrained model），所以整体 K* 不变。\n\n      Degradation ordering Spearman=0.78 低于 cross-model continuation 的 ρ=0.85+，\n      因为 retrain-chain 引入了 model-adaptation-specific 的 feature 重排——\n      是 expected 的 partial divergence。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Prompt-chain vs Retrain-chain Comparison (Pythia-1.4B)\"\n        columns: [metric, prompt_chain, retrain_chain, delta]\n        rows:\n          - [K*, 2, 2, \"=\"]\n          - [1v2 AUC, 0.6539, 0.6317, -0.0222]\n          - [2v3 AUC, 0.5515, 0.5612, +0.0097]\n          - [ordinal accuracy, 0.383, 0.3734, -0.0096]\n          - [feature KL divergence, \"—\", 0.147, \"—\"]\n          - [degradation ordering ρ, \"—\", 0.783, \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side AUC decay curves: prompt-chain vs retrain-chain。两条曲线形状相似，retrain-chain 的 1v2 point 略低但 2v3 point 略高（retrain adaptation 使 depth 2-3 的差异被放大）。\"\n      - \"Feature distribution violin plots: 6 panel (top 6 features), 每 panel 2 violins (prompt vs retrain)。surp_d1_std 和 surp_std 分布接近，freq_entropy 和 ttr 分布明显偏移。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Retrain-chain ecological validity check 成功——K*=2 在更接近真实 model collapse\n      的 pipeline 中仍然成立。1v2 AUC 的 2pp 下降和 feature ordering 的 partial\n      divergence (ρ=0.78) 都在预期范围内，可以在 Discussion 中用于 caveating\n      prompt-chain 的 ecological validity：'The prompt-chain experimental setup\n      is a conservative proxy for real-world recursive contamination. Retrain-chain\n      validation shows K*=2 is preserved, with a modest 2pp reduction in 1v2 AUC\n      attributable to model adaptation effects.'\n\n  - name: \"Contamination dose-response\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-009\"\n    description: >\n      在 10%/30%/50% synthetic injection 比例下测试 graduated vs binary filtering 的收益差异。\n    expected_results:\n      injection_10pct:\n        binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5984\n        graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5979\n        delta: 0.0005\n        paired_p: 0.412\n        note: \"difference not significant at 10% injection\"\n      injection_30pct:\n        binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5961\n        graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5943\n        delta: 0.0018\n        paired_p: 0.087\n        note: \"marginally significant\"\n      injection_50pct:\n        binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5941\n        graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5892\n        delta: 0.0049\n        paired_p: 0.003\n        note: \"significant, matches exp-006 reference\"\n      dose_response_slope: \"~0.001pp binary advantage per 1% injection increase\"\n      no_filter_baseline:\n        injection_10pct: 0.5978\n        injection_30pct: 0.5932\n        injection_50pct: 0.5865\n    result_rationale: >\n      Dose-response 的 median 档预测逻辑：低注入比例下（10%），contaminated samples\n      对 training set 的影响有限，任何 filtering 策略都几乎等效于 no-filter——因为\n      90% clean data dominates training signal。Binary vs graduated 的差异被 clean\n      data 的 buffer effect 稀释。\n\n      随注入比例增加：(1) binary filtering 的 advantage 线性增长——它完整移除 K*\n      boundary 以上的 contaminated samples；(2) graduated filtering 的 soft weighting\n      保留了部分 contaminated samples（虽然降权），这些 residual contamination 在\n      高注入比例下累积效应更大；(3) 50% injection 复现 exp-006 结果。\n\n      Dose-response 斜率（~0.001pp/1%）意味着在真实世界的 5-15% contamination\n      rate 下，binary vs graduated 差异 <0.5pp MMLU——K*-aware binary filtering\n      的实际优势主要体现在高污染场景。论文中这一结果 nuance C3 claim：\n      binary filtering 是 universally optimal 但 marginal gain 依赖 contamination\n      severity。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Dose-Response: Binary vs Graduated Filtering MMLU\"\n        columns: [injection_rate, no_filter, binary_ours, graduated_a09, \"Δ(bin-grad)\", p_value]\n        rows:\n          - [\"10%\", 0.5978, 0.5984, 0.5979, +0.0005, 0.412]\n          - [\"30%\", 0.5932, 0.5961, 0.5943, +0.0018, 0.087]\n          - [\"50%\", 0.5865, 0.5941, 0.5892, +0.0049, 0.003]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dose-response line chart: x=injection rate, y=MMLU, 3 lines (no-filter, binary, graduated)。Binary 线始终最高，no-filter 线下降最快。三线在 10% 处几乎重合，50% 处 fan out。标注 significance brackets。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Dose-response 为 C3 提供 practical calibration：K*-aware binary filtering\n      在任何 contamination level 下都 ≥ graduated，但 marginal gain scales with\n      contamination severity。论文 Practical Implications 段可写：'At typical\n      estimated web contamination rates (10-20%), binary K*-aware filtering provides\n      modest but consistent improvement; at higher rates (≥30%), the advantage\n      becomes substantial.'\n\n  - name: \"Naturalistic validation on Common Crawl\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: >\n      对 Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot 样本做 depth 预测，与 AlignScore 和独立\n      vocabulary richness 指标做 correlation。P2 wild-data 验证。\n    expected_results:\n      n_samples: 50000\n      predicted_depth_distribution:\n        depth_0: 0.72\n        depth_1: 0.18\n        depth_2: 0.07\n        depth_3_plus: 0.03\n      correlation_with_alignscore:\n        spearman_rho: 0.341\n        p_value: \"<0.001\"\n        note: \"moderate positive correlation — higher predicted depth associates with lower AlignScore\"\n      correlation_with_vocab_richness:\n        ttr_spearman: 0.423\n        hapax_spearman: 0.389\n        note: \"predicted depth anti-correlates with diversity metrics as expected\"\n      calibration_note: \"no ground truth depth available; correlations are indirect validation\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Common Crawl naturalistic validation 是 inherently weak 的——没有 ground truth\n      depth labels，只能做 indirect correlation。Median 档预测：\n\n      Depth distribution 重度右偏（72% depth-0）反映 CC 中大部分文本仍是\n      human-authored。18% depth-1（单次 LLM 生成）是合理的 2025-2026 估计。\n      3% depth-3+ 对应 recursive pipeline outputs（chatbot chains, recursive\n      summarization outputs）。\n\n      AlignScore 相关性偏低（ρ=0.34）因为 AlignScore 衡量 factual consistency\n      而非 generational depth——depth-2 text 的事实性可能与 depth-1 无显著差异\n      （K*=2 的含义正是如此）。Vocabulary richness 相关性更高（ρ=0.42）因为\n      diversity compression 是 depth signal 的核心 component，与 15D features\n      直接相关。\n\n      这个实验的 median 结果只能作为 supporting evidence，不能进入 main claims。\n      论文 Appendix 定位为 'preliminary naturalistic application'。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Common Crawl 2025/2026 Depth Prediction Summary\"\n        columns: [metric, value]\n        rows:\n          - [n_samples, 50000]\n          - [predicted depth-0 fraction, 0.72]\n          - [predicted depth-1 fraction, 0.18]\n          - [predicted depth-2 fraction, 0.07]\n          - [predicted depth-3+ fraction, 0.03]\n          - [AlignScore correlation (ρ), 0.341]\n          - [TTR correlation (ρ), 0.423]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Predicted depth distribution histogram: heavy left skew, 72% depth-0。与 2024 CC snapshot 的 predicted distribution 做 overlay（如有）对比 temporal trend。\"\n      - \"Scatter plot: predicted depth vs AlignScore / TTR, 带 regression line。Moderate trend visible but high scatter。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Naturalistic validation 提供 face validity 但不能作为 strong evidence。\n      论文中定位为 Appendix 的 preliminary application，仅 claim 'predicted depth\n      distribution is consistent with expected contamination rates'。AlignScore\n      correlation 的 moderate 值实际上与 K*=2 一致——如果 depth>2 的区分力确实\n      消失，那么高 depth 文本的 quality metrics 就不应该 systematically worse\n      than depth-2。\n\n  - name: \"Domain ablation: Wikipedia seed data\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-023\"\n    description: >\n      Wikipedia seed data, Qwen2.5-1.5B (base) continuation mode, C4→Wikipedia 域迁移。\n      验证 K*=2 是否跨数据域一致。当前 orphaned。\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9912\n        1v2: 0.6067\n        2v3: 0.5534\n        3v4: 0.5278\n        4v5: 0.5098\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        1v2: {auc: 0.6067, ci_lower: 0.5961, ci_upper: 0.6173, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {auc: 0.5534, ci_lower: 0.5428, ci_upper: 0.5640, perm_p: 0.0001}\n      ordinal_mae: 1.189\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3651\n      feature_ranking_shift:\n        c4_vs_wikipedia_spearman: 0.821\n        shifted_feature: \"freq_entropy moves from rank 1 to rank 4; surp_d1_std becomes dominant\"\n        note: \"Wikipedia's more structured vocabulary reduces freq_entropy discriminative power\"\n      k_star_note: \"K*=2 but CI lower=0.5961 marginally below θ — borderline, may need classification as K*=1\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Wikipedia 与 C4 的关键差异：Wikipedia 文本更 structured（formal register,\n      encyclopedic style, consistent vocabulary usage），导致 freq_entropy 在\n      baseline (depth-0) 就较低且 variance 小——frequency-based features 的\n      discriminative headroom 被压缩。Depth signal 更依赖 surprisal-based features，\n      但 Wikipedia 的 formulaic structure 也使 surprisal 分布更 peaked。\n\n      K*=2 可能 borderline (CI lower ~0.596)——Wikipedia 的 structured nature 使\n      continuation-mode generation 更 constrained（模型倾向于延续 encyclopedic\n      style），successive generations 的 distributional shift 比 C4 更 subtle。\n      这是 domain-specific effect 而非 K*_theory 的变化——DPI 的 information loss\n      rate 对 Wikipedia 可能更低（structured text 有更高的 redundancy，information\n      loss per generation 更小），使 K*_theory 可能 >2 但 K*_empirical 在 features\n      的 sensitivity 边界上 wobble。\n\n      Orphaned status 意味着这个实验可能不会被完成，但如果完成，median 档预测\n      K*=2 with high uncertainty。论文中可以 omit 或放入 Appendix。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Domain Ablation: C4 vs Wikipedia (Qwen-base, continuation)\"\n        columns: [domain, 0v1_auc, 1v2_auc, 1v2_ci_lower, k_star, top_feature]\n        rows:\n          - [C4, 0.987, 0.626, 0.617, 2, freq_entropy]\n          - [Wikipedia, 0.991, 0.607, 0.596, \"2*\", surp_d1_std]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Domain comparison AUC decay: C4 vs Wikipedia，两条曲线在 0v1 几乎重合，1v2 处 Wikipedia 低约 2pp。θ 线标注，Wikipedia 1v2 error bar 跨越 θ。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain ablation（如果完成）会 further scope C1'——Wikipedia 的 borderline\n      result 提示 structured domains 可能需要 domain-adapted features 或更长文本\n      以达到可靠的 K*=2。论文中作为 limitation 提及：'K*=2 is demonstrated on\n      general web text (C4); highly structured domains such as Wikipedia may require\n      domain-specific feature calibration.' 但不影响 main claim，因为 C4 是\n      web contamination 的 primary target domain。\n\n  # Aggregate summary for paper narrative\n  aggregate_summary:\n    total_conditions_tested: 19\n    total_conditions_kstar2: 14\n    total_conditions_kstar1: 5\n    kstar2_conditions_list:\n      existing_10: \"Qwen-rw, Pythia-cont, OLMo-cont, Qwen-greedy, Qwen-nuc0.9, Qwen-T0.7, Qwen-T1.2, Qwen-7B, Qwen-base, Qwen-cont\"\n      new_4: \"LLaMA-8B, Pythia-greedy, Pythia-nuc0.9, Pythia-T1.2, length-256, length-512\"\n    kstar1_conditions_list:\n      - \"Mistral-7B (architecture-specific SWA smoothing)\"\n      - \"Pythia T=0.7 (borderline — low-temp diversity compression)\"\n      - \"128-token length (information insufficiency)\"\n      - \"exp-023 Wikipedia (borderline — domain-specific feature sensitivity)\"\n    cross_scorer_kstar2: \"12/16 = 75%\"\n    paper_headline_revision: >\n      From: 'K*=2 is invariant across all 10 tested conditions'\n      To: 'K*=2 is a robust discrimination boundary across 14/19 tested conditions\n      spanning 5 architecture families (1B-8B), 8 decoding configurations, base+instruct,\n      and 2 text lengths (≥256 tokens). The 5 boundary cases are principled:\n      3 reflect feature sensitivity limits (short text, low-temperature decoding,\n      architecture-specific attention mechanisms) consistent with DPI theory;\n      2 are scorer-alignment artifacts addressable by same-family scoring.'\n    c1_prime_final_wording: >\n      K*=2 is a robust discrimination boundary under standard conditions\n      (≥256 tokens; standard decoding temperature; self-scorer or same-family scorer),\n      invariant across 5 model architecture families at 1B-8B scale.\n    rebuttal_strategy:\n      reviewer_universality_attack: >\n        'We acknowledge K*=2 does not hold universally — it fails under 3 principled\n        boundary conditions (Section 4.x). These boundary cases are predicted by\n        DPI theory: K*_theory remains ≥2 in all cases, but K*_empirical depends\n        on feature sensitivity to residual mutual information. The 14/19 success rate\n        across deliberately diverse conditions (5 architectures, 8 decoding configs,\n        3 text lengths, 16 scorer combinations) demonstrates robustness, not\n        cherry-picked universality.'\n      reviewer_scale_attack: >\n        'LLaMA-3.1-8B confirms K*=2 (CI lower 0.606 > θ), extending coverage to 8B.\n        Mistral-7B K*=1 is explained by SWA-specific smoothing (Section 4.x),\n        not scale effects — at 7B Mistral is larger than our 4 confirmed ≤1.5B\n        models. DPI guarantees K*_theory exists for all model sizes; 13B+ validation\n        is important future work.'\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":226,"cache_read_input_tokens":44823,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":226},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"605bf23b-1e59-4eaf-b1b1-77c0ed9853ff","uuid":"e15f0c29-7b8d-40f8-b08e-b375c26c8511"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":635088,"duration_api_ms":636629,"num_turns":2,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Universality claim scoped 为 'K*=2 is a robust discrimination boundary under standard\n  conditions (≥256 tokens; standard decoding; self-scorer or same-family scorer)'。\n  两个新模型族中 LLaMA 确认 K*=2 但边缘，Mistral 1v2 AUC 落入 0.58-0.60 灰区，论文中定位为\n  architecture-specific information loss rate boundary case 而非 counterexample——\n  Mistral 的 sliding window attention 引入非标准 context truncation，\n  DPI 框架预测此类 architecture 的 K*_theory 可能仍为 2 但 K*_empirical 因 feature\n  sensitivity 不足而降至 1。Pythia decoding ablation 3/4 确认 K*=2，\n  T=0.7 配置为边缘案例（CI lower ~0.598），分析为低温解码压缩 token diversity 导致\n  15D 特征的信息量降低。128-token 长度条件 K*=1 是 DPI 预测的 principled failure——\n  短文本互信息不足以支撑 depth>1 的区分。Cross-scorer matrix 重现 exp_A 的\n  scorer-dependence 模式但可控（~75% cells K*=2），论文增加 'Boundary conditions\n  of universality' 分析段落。C1' 降为 'K*=2 is a robust discrimination boundary\n  under standard conditions'。仍冲 EMNLP Main，rebuttal 策略：承认 scope +\n  强调已覆盖条件一致性 + DPI 理论预测泛化合理性。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  - name: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B cross-family depth chain\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-018\"\n    description: >\n      LLaMA-3.1-8B continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5,\n      scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。新模型族中的「确认方」——K*=2 成立但 CI lower 边缘。\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9712\n        1v2: 0.6163\n        2v3: 0.5538\n        3v4: 0.5247\n        4v5: 0.5103\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0028\n        1v2: 0.0089\n        2v3: 0.0061\n        3v4: 0.0095\n        4v5: 0.0072\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1: {auc: 0.9712, ci_lower: 0.9681, ci_upper: 0.9741, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        1v2: {auc: 0.6163, ci_lower: 0.6058, ci_upper: 0.6268, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {auc: 0.5538, ci_lower: 0.5432, ci_upper: 0.5644, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        3v4: {auc: 0.5247, ci_lower: 0.5142, ci_upper: 0.5352, perm_p: 0.0003}\n        4v5: {auc: 0.5103, ci_lower: 0.4998, ci_upper: 0.5208, perm_p: 0.0812}\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.11483\n        1v2: 0.00926\n        2v3: 0.00487\n        3v4: 0.00412\n        4v5: 0.00338\n      ordinal_mae: 1.198\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3491\n      top_features: [surp_d1_std, freq_entropy, surp_std, surp_mean, surp_d1_skew]\n      bootstrap_resamples: 10000\n      permutation_resamples: 10000\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLaMA-3.1-8B 是 Meta 的 Transformer 架构，与已验证的 Pythia/OLMo（GPT-2 style）\n      和 Qwen（Alibaba）形成第三个独立架构族。8B 规模下，cross-scorer（Qwen-1.5B 计算\n      surprisal features）引入约 2-3pp 的信号衰减（对比 exp-004 的 Qwen-7B self-scored\n      1v2=0.6178）。LLaMA 的 GQA attention 和 RoPE 编码使其 generation 分布与 Qwen 的\n      差异大于 Pythia/OLMo 之间的差异，但 depth degradation 的核心模式（surprisal\n      variance 增加、diversity 压缩）仍足以被 15D features 捕获。1v2 CI lower=0.6058\n      高于 θ=0.60 约 0.6pp——边缘但 pass。0v1 AUC 从其他模型的 0.97-0.99 降至 0.971，\n      因 cross-scorer surprisal 计算对 LLaMA tokenizer 不完全对齐，但 binary detection\n      仍然 robust。4v5 perm_p=0.08 不显著，与 exp-004 的 4v5 p=0.0676 一致——\n      深层代际区分力确实消失。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B Pairwise AUC with Bootstrap CI\"\n        columns: [depth_pair, auc, ci_lower, ci_upper, perm_p, \"K* at θ=0.60\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0v1, 0.9712, 0.9681, 0.9741, 0.0001, \"—\"]\n          - [1v2, 0.6163, 0.6058, 0.6268, 0.0001, \"K*=2 ✅ (edge, +0.58pp)\"]\n          - [2v3, 0.5538, 0.5432, 0.5644, 0.0001, \"< θ\"]\n          - [3v4, 0.5247, 0.5142, 0.5352, 0.0003, \"< θ\"]\n          - [4v5, 0.5103, 0.4998, 0.5208, 0.0812, \"n.s.\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"AUC decay curve: LLaMA-8B 叠加在 existing 5 models 上。LLaMA 的 1v2 AUC 位于 OLMo(0.615) 和 Qwen-cont(0.611) 之间，延续 cross-scorer 条件下信号衰减的规律。Decay 曲线形状与其他模型一致——steep 0v1→1v2 drop，后续近似平坦。\"\n      - \"Cross-family comparison radar chart: 6 个模型在 5 个 depth pair 上的 AUC，LLaMA 的 profile 与 OLMo 最相似。\"\n    analysis: >\n      LLaMA-8B K*=2 确认 universality 扩展至第三个独立架构族和 8B 规模。CI lower\n      0.6058 的边缘性源于 cross-scorer 设置——Qwen-1.5B 的 surprisal 估计对 LLaMA\n      tokenization 的系统性偏差（LLaMA 使用 BPE 32K vocab vs Qwen 的 151K vocab，\n      subword 粒度差异导致 surprisal 统计量的 calibration 偏移）。若使用 self-scorer，\n      1v2 AUC 预计可达 0.63+。论文中定位为 C1'(a) 的关键扩展证据：K*=2 跨越\n      {GPT-2 style, Qwen, LLaMA} 三个主要开源架构族和 1B-8B 规模。\n\n  - name: \"Mistral-7B-v0.3 cross-family depth chain\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-019\"\n    description: >\n      Mistral-7B-v0.3 continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5,\n      scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。新模型族中的「边缘/失败方」——1v2 AUC 落入 0.58-0.60 灰区。\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 1\n      k_star_note: \"1v2 AUC > 0.58 but CI lower < 0.60; formally K*=1 under strict CI criterion\"\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9683\n        1v2: 0.5934\n        2v3: 0.5412\n        3v4: 0.5189\n        4v5: 0.5067\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0031\n        1v2: 0.0094\n        2v3: 0.0073\n        3v4: 0.0088\n        4v5: 0.0081\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1: {auc: 0.9683, ci_lower: 0.9649, ci_upper: 0.9715, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        1v2: {auc: 0.5934, ci_lower: 0.5828, ci_upper: 0.6040, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {auc: 0.5412, ci_lower: 0.5306, ci_upper: 0.5518, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        3v4: {auc: 0.5189, ci_lower: 0.5083, ci_upper: 0.5295, perm_p: 0.0018}\n        4v5: {auc: 0.5067, ci_lower: 0.4961, ci_upper: 0.5173, perm_p: 0.1543}\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.10892\n        1v2: 0.00753\n        2v3: 0.00421\n        3v4: 0.00356\n        4v5: 0.00301\n      ordinal_mae: 1.243\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3367\n      top_features: [surp_d1_std, surp_std, freq_entropy, surp_mean, surp_d1_mean]\n      bootstrap_resamples: 10000\n      permutation_resamples: 10000\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mistral-7B 的 sliding window attention (SWA, window=4096) 与标准 full attention\n      的关键区别：SWA 在长序列中截断远距离 dependency，使 continuation-mode 生成的文本\n      在局部 n-gram 层面保持更高的 coherence（因为 attention 只看近邻），但全局\n      discourse structure 的退化被部分掩盖。这导致 15D surprisal-based features 在\n      捕获 depth 信号时效率降低——surp_d1_std 和 surp_std 对 Mistral 生成文本的\n      discriminative power 比 full-attention 模型低约 1.5-2pp。1v2 AUC=0.5934，\n      point estimate 接近 θ=0.60 但 CI lower=0.5828 明确低于阈值。这不是\n      K*_theory=1 的证据——Mistral 的 binary detection（0v1=0.968）依然 strong，\n      说明 depth-1 vs depth-0 的信号存在且 robust。问题在于 depth-1 vs depth-2 的\n      incremental signal 被 SWA 的 local smoothing 效应压缩到 15D features 无法\n      在 θ=0.60 下可靠检测的水平。DPI 理论预测：K*_theory 仍为 2（信息论上\n      generation 1→2 的信息损失非零），但 K*_empirical 因 feature sensitivity\n      不足降至 1。Neural probe（如果测试）预计可恢复 K*=2。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Mistral-7B Pairwise AUC with Bootstrap CI\"\n        columns: [depth_pair, auc, ci_lower, ci_upper, perm_p, \"K* at θ=0.60\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0v1, 0.9683, 0.9649, 0.9715, 0.0001, \"—\"]\n          - [1v2, 0.5934, 0.5828, 0.6040, 0.0001, \"K*=1 ⚠️ (CI lower 0.583 < θ)\"]\n          - [2v3, 0.5412, 0.5306, 0.5518, 0.0001, \"< θ\"]\n          - [3v4, 0.5189, 0.5083, 0.5295, 0.0018, \"< θ\"]\n          - [4v5, 0.5067, 0.4961, 0.5173, 0.1543, \"n.s.\"]\n      - title: \"New Model Family Summary (exp-018 + exp-019)\"\n        columns: [model, scale, architecture, 1v2_auc, ci_lower, k_star, verdict]\n        rows:\n          - [LLaMA-3.1-8B, 8B, \"full attention + GQA + RoPE\", 0.6163, 0.6058, 2, \"confirmed (edge)\"]\n          - [Mistral-7B-v0.3, 7B, \"SWA + GQA + RoPE\", 0.5934, 0.5828, 1, \"boundary case\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Comparative AUC decay curves: Mistral 的 1v2 point 明显低于 LLaMA 和所有已验证模型。图中用虚线标注 θ=0.60 threshold，Mistral 的 1v2 error bar 跨越 threshold，是唯一一个 CI 跨 θ 的条件。\"\n      - \"Architecture comparison scatter: x=0v1 AUC, y=1v2 AUC。所有模型的 0v1 都 clustered 在 0.96-0.99，但 1v2 展开——Mistral 是 outlier。标注 SWA vs full attention 区分。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Mistral K*=1 是 median 档的核心 scoping event。论文中不应将其呈现为 universality\n      的 counterexample，而是 architecture-specific boundary condition。Narrative 策略：\n      (1) 承认 Mistral 在 15D features 下 K*=1；(2) 指出 0v1 AUC=0.968 证明 depth\n      signal 存在，问题在 feature sensitivity 而非 signal absence；(3) 用 SWA 的\n      local smoothing 给出 mechanistic 解释——attention window 截断导致 discourse-level\n      degradation 在 local statistics 中被平滑；(4) 指出 1v2 point estimate=0.593\n      距 θ 仅 0.7pp，neural probe 预计可恢复 K*=2。Discussion 中加入 'Boundary\n      conditions of universality' 段落，将 Mistral 与 128-token 长度条件并列为\n      principled boundary cases。C1' 措辞从 'universal across all tested conditions'\n      降为 'robust under standard conditions'，Mistral 和 128-token 作为 informative\n      scope delineation。\n\n  - name: \"Pythia-1.4B decoding strategy ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-020\"\n    description: >\n      Pythia-1.4B 四种解码策略（greedy / nucleus p=0.9 / T=0.7 / T=1.2），C4 5K docs,\n      depth 0-5。跨模型验证 exp-003 的解码策略不变性。3/4 确认 K*=2，T=0.7 边缘。\n    expected_results:\n      config1_greedy:\n        k_star: 2\n        pairwise_auc:\n          0v1: 0.9823\n          1v2: 0.6412\n          2v3: 0.5487\n          3v4: 0.5198\n          4v5: 0.5112\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9823, ci_lower: 0.9801, ci_upper: 0.9845, perm_p: 0.0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6412, ci_lower: 0.6308, ci_upper: 0.6516, perm_p: 0.0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5487, ci_lower: 0.5384, ci_upper: 0.5590, perm_p: 0.0}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5198, ci_lower: 0.5093, ci_upper: 0.5303, perm_p: 0.0004}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5112, ci_lower: 0.5007, ci_upper: 0.5217, perm_p: 0.0234}\n      config2_nuc09:\n        k_star: 2\n        pairwise_auc:\n          0v1: 0.9917\n          1v2: 0.6498\n          2v3: 0.5523\n          3v4: 0.5214\n          4v5: 0.5089\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9917, ci_lower: 0.9903, ci_upper: 0.9931, perm_p: 0.0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6498, ci_lower: 0.6395, ci_upper: 0.6601, perm_p: 0.0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5523, ci_lower: 0.5419, ci_upper: 0.5627, perm_p: 0.0}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5214, ci_lower: 0.5109, ci_upper: 0.5319, perm_p: 0.0002}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5089, ci_lower: 0.4984, ci_upper: 0.5194, perm_p: 0.0923}\n      config3_t07:\n        k_star: 2\n        k_star_note: \"borderline — CI lower 0.5983 barely misses θ=0.60; point estimate above θ\"\n        pairwise_auc:\n          0v1: 0.9854\n          1v2: 0.6103\n          2v3: 0.5456\n          3v4: 0.5167\n          4v5: 0.5098\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9854, ci_lower: 0.9834, ci_upper: 0.9874, perm_p: 0.0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6103, ci_lower: 0.5983, ci_upper: 0.6223, perm_p: 0.0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5456, ci_lower: 0.5348, ci_upper: 0.5564, perm_p: 0.0}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5167, ci_lower: 0.5058, ci_upper: 0.5276, perm_p: 0.0012}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5098, ci_lower: 0.4990, ci_upper: 0.5206, perm_p: 0.0567}\n      config4_t12:\n        k_star: 2\n        pairwise_auc:\n          0v1: 0.9961\n          1v2: 0.6673\n          2v3: 0.5568\n          3v4: 0.5231\n          4v5: 0.5154\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9961, ci_lower: 0.9951, ci_upper: 0.9970, perm_p: 0.0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6673, ci_lower: 0.6568, ci_upper: 0.6778, perm_p: 0.0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5568, ci_lower: 0.5462, ci_upper: 0.5674, perm_p: 0.0}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5231, ci_lower: 0.5122, ci_upper: 0.5340, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5154, ci_lower: 0.5047, ci_upper: 0.5261, perm_p: 0.0048}\n      method: \"GroupKFold(5) OOF + doc-level bootstrap (10K) + label permutation (10K)\"\n      kstar2_fraction: 0.75\n      kstar2_fraction_note: \"3/4 clear K*=2 by CI lower > θ; config3_t07 CI lower=0.5983 is 0.17pp below θ, point estimate K*=2\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Pythia-1.4B baseline (nucleus p=0.95) 1v2=0.6539 是所有 continuation 模型中\n      次高的。四种解码策略的预测逻辑：\n\n      **Greedy (1v2=0.641)**: deterministic decoding 消除 sampling variance 但保留\n      model's MAP estimate。Pythia 的 greedy output 比 nucleus 略更 repetitive\n      （self_BLEU 更高），导致 diversity features（ttr, hapax_ratio）的 depth signal\n      被压缩。Greedy AUC 比 nucleus 低约 1pp，与 Qwen 上的 pattern 一致\n      （Qwen greedy 0.6892 vs nucleus 0.6862, 差异更小因为 Qwen-rw mode 本身就\n      有 instruction-driven diversity）。\n\n      **Nucleus p=0.9 (1v2=0.650)**: 接近 baseline (p=0.95)，sampling distribution\n      略窄导致 top-p cutoff 处的 token selection 差异小。与 baseline 的差异在\n      noise 范围内。\n\n      **T=0.7 (1v2=0.610, EDGE)**: 低温解码是四种策略中最 problematic 的——\n      T=0.7 将 logit distribution 锐化，使 Pythia 在每步生成时都倾向高概率 token，\n      连续多代生成后 text diversity 的 baseline 被压得很低，导致 depth-1 和 depth-2\n      的 15D feature 分布差异被压缩。关键机制：低温使 surprisal distribution\n      更 peaked（surp_std 减小），而 surp_std 恰好是 top discriminative feature——\n      当 feature 本身的 variance 被压缩时，它区分不同 depth 的能力也随之下降。\n      CI lower=0.5983 距 θ 仅 -0.17pp，在统计意义上属于 「不可区分于 θ」 的范围。\n      论文中 Pythia T=0.7 和 Qwen-cont（CI lower=0.6015, +0.15pp）形成对称的\n      双端 edge cases。\n\n      **T=1.2 (1v2=0.667)**: 高温解码增加 token diversity，使 successive generations\n      的 diversity 压缩更显著，depth signal 被放大。与 exp-003 的 Qwen T=1.2\n      (0.7037) pattern 一致——高温是最有利于 depth discrimination 的解码配置。\n      Pythia T=1.2 的 1v2 比 baseline 高约 1.3pp，幅度略小于 Qwen（因 continuation\n      mode 的 signal amplification 弱于 rewrite）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Pythia-1.4B Decoding Ablation Summary\"\n        columns: [decoding, 1v2_auc, ci_lower, ci_upper, k_star, verdict]\n        rows:\n          - [greedy, 0.6412, 0.6308, 0.6516, 2, \"✅ clear\"]\n          - [\"nucleus p=0.9\", 0.6498, 0.6395, 0.6601, 2, \"✅ clear\"]\n          - [T=0.7, 0.6103, 0.5983, 0.6223, \"2*\", \"⚠️ CI lower < θ by 0.17pp\"]\n          - [T=1.2, 0.6673, 0.6568, 0.6778, 2, \"✅ clear\"]\n      - title: \"Cross-model Decoding Invariance Comparison (Qwen exp-003 vs Pythia exp-020)\"\n        columns: [decoding, \"Qwen-rw 1v2\", \"Pythia 1v2\", \"Δ\", \"both K*=2?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [greedy, 0.6892, 0.6412, -0.0480, \"✅ / ✅\"]\n          - [\"nucleus p=0.9\", 0.6862, 0.6498, -0.0364, \"✅ / ✅\"]\n          - [T=0.7, 0.6885, 0.6103, -0.0782, \"✅ / ⚠️ edge\"]\n          - [T=1.2, 0.7037, 0.6673, -0.0364, \"✅ / ✅\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Decoding strategy × model interaction heatmap: 8 cells (4 decoding × 2 models), 颜色编码 1v2 AUC。Pythia 行整体低于 Qwen 行约 4-8pp，但 pattern 一致：T=1.2 最高，T=0.7 最低。Pythia T=0.7 是唯一一个 AUC 接近 θ 的 cell。\"\n      - \"AUC vs temperature/sampling 参数散点图: x=decoding parameter (对 greedy 标为 'deterministic'), y=1v2 AUC, 两条线分别对应 Qwen 和 Pythia。两线近似平行但 Pythia 线整体下移。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Pythia decoding ablation 的核心发现是 K*=2 在 7/8 decoding×model 组合中 robust\n      （exp-003 4/4 + exp-020 3/4），唯一 edge case (Pythia T=0.7) 有清晰的\n      mechanistic 解释。T=0.7 的边缘性不是 random noise——它是 model-specific signal\n      strength 与 decoding-induced diversity compression 的 interaction。Pythia\n      的 baseline 1v2 AUC（0.654）比 Qwen-rw（0.696）低 4pp，这 4pp 的 margin\n      在 T=0.7 的 diversity compression 下被消耗殆尽。论文中可写：「K*=2 is invariant\n      to decoding strategy for both tested architectures, with a single borderline\n      case (Pythia, T=0.7) where low-temperature decoding compresses the already\n      moderate depth signal below the detection threshold. This is consistent with\n      the information-theoretic prediction that K*_empirical depends on the feature\n      set's sensitivity to the residual mutual information I(X_k; X_{k+1}).」\n\n  - name: \"Text length ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-021\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation, 128/256/512 tokens, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5。\n      验证 K* 对文本长度的敏感性。128-token 预期 K*=1（信息量不足），256/512 K*=2。\n    expected_results:\n      length_128:\n        k_star: 1\n        pairwise_auc:\n          0v1: 0.9847\n          1v2: 0.5912\n          2v3: 0.5389\n          3v4: 0.5194\n          4v5: 0.5078\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9847, ci_lower: 0.9823, ci_upper: 0.9871, perm_p: 0.0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.5912, ci_lower: 0.5793, ci_upper: 0.6031, perm_p: 0.0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5389, ci_lower: 0.5271, ci_upper: 0.5507, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5194, ci_lower: 0.5078, ci_upper: 0.5310, perm_p: 0.0039}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5078, ci_lower: 0.4963, ci_upper: 0.5193, perm_p: 0.1678}\n        ordinal_mae: 1.267\n        ordinal_accuracy: 0.3298\n      length_256:\n        k_star: 2\n        pairwise_auc:\n          0v1: 0.9942\n          1v2: 0.6187\n          2v3: 0.5562\n          3v4: 0.5341\n          4v5: 0.5118\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9942, ci_lower: 0.9930, ci_upper: 0.9954, perm_p: 0.0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6187, ci_lower: 0.6078, ci_upper: 0.6296, perm_p: 0.0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5562, ci_lower: 0.5454, ci_upper: 0.5670, perm_p: 0.0}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5341, ci_lower: 0.5234, ci_upper: 0.5448, perm_p: 0.0}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5118, ci_lower: 0.5011, ci_upper: 0.5225, perm_p: 0.0189}\n        ordinal_mae: 1.182\n        ordinal_accuracy: 0.3612\n      length_512:\n        k_star: 2\n        pairwise_auc:\n          0v1: 0.9969\n          1v2: 0.6134\n          2v3: 0.5598\n          3v4: 0.5387\n          4v5: 0.5132\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          0v1: {auc: 0.9969, ci_lower: 0.9960, ci_upper: 0.9977, perm_p: 0.0}\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6134, ci_lower: 0.6028, ci_upper: 0.6240, perm_p: 0.0}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5598, ci_lower: 0.5492, ci_upper: 0.5704, perm_p: 0.0}\n          3v4: {auc: 0.5387, ci_lower: 0.5280, ci_upper: 0.5494, perm_p: 0.0}\n          4v5: {auc: 0.5132, ci_lower: 0.5026, ci_upper: 0.5238, perm_p: 0.0078}\n        ordinal_mae: 1.162\n        ordinal_accuracy: 0.3783\n      length_baseline_comparison:\n        qwen_cont_default: {1v2_auc: 0.6112, note: \"default length ~512+ tokens\"}\n        key_delta: \"128→256: +2.75pp 1v2 AUC; 256→512: -0.53pp (plateau)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      文本长度对 15D features 的影响通过两个机制：(1) 统计估计精度——n-gram 频率、\n      surprisal 统计量在短文本上的方差更大，导致 per-document features 更 noisy；\n      (2) 信息总量——DPI 约束下每一代信息损失是固定的 rate，但 15D features 只能\n      捕获 aggregate statistics，短文本的 aggregate 包含的有效信息更少。\n\n      **128 tokens (K*=1)**: 128 tokens ≈ 90-100 词，对于 surprisal 统计量（mean,\n      std, skewness, kurtosis）的估计不够稳定。surp_d1_std（top feature）需要计算\n      token-level surprisal 的一阶差分的标准差——128 tokens 只有 ~127 个一阶差分样本，\n      其中有效的（非 padding、非 BOS/EOS）约 120 个。这个样本量下 std 估计的\n      standard error ≈ σ/√(2n) ≈ 0.065σ，足以使不同 depth 的 surp_d1_std 分布\n      重叠度大幅增加。1v2 AUC=0.591 距 θ 仅 -0.9pp，CI 上界 0.603 跨越 θ——\n      说明 128 tokens 处于 information-sufficient 边界，不是完全无信号，而是信号\n      不足以 reliably 超过 θ。这完美符合 DPI 理论的预测：K*_theory 不依赖文本长度\n      （信息论极限与样本量无关），但 K*_empirical 依赖 feature 估计的质量，\n      短文本使 estimation noise 掩盖了 true depth signal。\n\n      **256 tokens (K*=2)**: 256 tokens 提供 ~250 个有效样本点，std 估计的\n      standard error 降至 0.045σ，feature 分布重叠度降低到足以支撑 1v2 区分。\n      1v2 AUC=0.619 与 Qwen-cont baseline (0.611) 接近，说明 256 tokens 已\n      接近信息饱和。\n\n      **512 tokens (K*=2)**: 512 tokens 的 1v2 AUC=0.613 与 256 tokens (0.619)\n      几乎无差异（Δ=-0.5pp, within noise）——confirming 信息饱和发生在 256 tokens\n      附近。这与 NLP 中 document-level statistics 的 convergence 行为一致——\n      most distributional statistics converge by n≈200-300 tokens。512→default\n      也无提升（default 0.611 vs 512 0.613），进一步确认 plateau。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Length Ablation Results\"\n        columns: [length, 0v1_auc, 1v2_auc, 1v2_ci_lower, k_star, \"information sufficiency\"]\n        rows:\n          - [128, 0.9847, 0.5912, 0.5793, 1, \"insufficient — below θ\"]\n          - [256, 0.9942, 0.6187, 0.6078, 2, \"sufficient — above θ\"]\n          - [512, 0.9969, 0.6134, 0.6028, 2, \"sufficient — plateau\"]\n          - [\"default (~512+)\", 0.9971, 0.6112, 0.6015, 2, \"reference (exp-017)\"]\n      - title: \"Feature Estimation Quality by Length\"\n        columns: [length, surp_std_stderr_ratio, effective_samples, feature_overlap_1v2]\n        rows:\n          - [128, 0.065, \"~120\", \"high (AUC→0.59)\"]\n          - [256, 0.045, \"~250\", \"moderate (AUC→0.62)\"]\n          - [512, 0.032, \"~500\", \"moderate (AUC→0.61)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"1v2 AUC vs text length 曲线: x=token length (128, 256, 512, default), y=1v2 AUC。曲线在 128→256 急剧上升 (+2.75pp)，256→512 平坦（-0.5pp within noise）。θ=0.60 水平虚线标注，128 落在下方。\"\n      - \"AUC decay curves 按 length 分组: 三条 AUC decay curves (128/256/512)，128 的 1v2 point 明显低于其他两条，但三条曲线在 2v3 以后几乎重合——说明 length 效应集中在 near-boundary discrimination。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Length ablation 提供了 K*_empirical 的 principled lower bound condition：当文本\n      长度不足以支撑 15D features 的稳定估计时，K*_empirical 降至 1。这不是 K*_theory\n      的变化，而是 measurement precision 的限制。论文中这一结果有三重价值：\n      (1) 为 C1' 的 scope 提供 principled boundary——'≥256 tokens' 成为 K*=2 的\n      先决条件之一，而非 ad hoc limitation；\n      (2) 信息饱和 plateau 在 ~256 tokens 处，给出 practical deployment guidance\n      （无需等待完整文档，256 tokens 足以进行 depth estimation）；\n      (3) 128-token 的 failure 与 Mistral 的 failure 形成 parallel——两者都是\n      feature sensitivity 不足导致 K*_empirical < K*_theory，加强了 'K*=2 is a\n      property of the data, K*_empirical is a property of the measurement' 的论述。\n\n  - name: \"4×4 Cross-scorer independence matrix\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-022\"\n    description: >\n      4 generators (Qwen-cont, Pythia, OLMo, Qwen-base) × 4 scorers (same models),\n      验证 scorer independence 完整性。重现 exp_A 的 scorer-dependence 模式但量化可控性。\n    expected_results:\n      kstar2_fraction: 0.75\n      kstar2_count: \"12/16\"\n      kstar_matrix:\n        Qwen_cont_gen:\n          Qwen_cont_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6112, k_star: 2, note: \"self-scorer reference\"}\n          Pythia_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.5978, k_star: 1, note: \"cross-family K*=1\"}\n          OLMo_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.5923, k_star: 1, note: \"cross-family K*=1\"}\n          Qwen_base_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6089, k_star: 2, note: \"same-family scorer, CI lower ~0.600\"}\n        Pythia_gen:\n          Qwen_cont_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.5931, k_star: 1, note: \"matches exp_A pattern\"}\n          Pythia_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6539, k_star: 2, note: \"self-scorer reference\"}\n          OLMo_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6387, k_star: 2, note: \"similar architecture\"}\n          Qwen_base_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6102, k_star: 2, note: \"cross-family but sufficient\"}\n        OLMo_gen:\n          Qwen_cont_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.5864, k_star: 1, note: \"matches exp_A pattern\"}\n          Pythia_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6298, k_star: 2, note: \"similar architecture\"}\n          OLMo_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6145, k_star: 2, note: \"self-scorer reference\"}\n          Qwen_base_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6031, k_star: 2, note: \"cross-family edge, CI lower ~0.602\"}\n        Qwen_base_gen:\n          Qwen_cont_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6223, k_star: 2, note: \"same-family scorer\"}\n          Pythia_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6078, k_star: 2, note: \"cross-family, just above θ\"}\n          OLMo_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6012, k_star: 2, note: \"cross-family edge\"}\n          Qwen_base_scorer: {1v2_auc: 0.6262, k_star: 2, note: \"self-scorer reference\"}\n      feature_rank_correlation:\n        mean_spearman_rho: 0.912\n        min_spearman_rho: 0.867\n        note: \"Feature importance ranking highly stable across all 16 scorer conditions (ρ ≥ 0.87)\"\n      k_star_1_cells: [\"Qwen-cont→Pythia-scorer\", \"Qwen-cont→OLMo-scorer\", \"Pythia→Qwen-cont-scorer\", \"OLMo→Qwen-cont-scorer\"]\n      k_star_1_pattern: \"K*=1 only occurs when Qwen-Instruct-cont is one endpoint (generator or scorer) and the other is Pythia/OLMo — same pattern as exp_A\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-scorer matrix 的核心 pattern 源于 surprisal feature 计算的 scorer-dependence：\n      15D features 中 6/15 是 surprisal-based（surp_mean, surp_std, surp_skew,\n      surp_d1_*, surp_d2_*），它们依赖 scorer model 的 tokenizer 和 language model\n      distribution。当 scorer 与 generator 来自不同架构族时：\n\n      **K*=1 cells (4/16)**: 全部涉及 Qwen-Instruct-cont 与 Pythia/OLMo 的交叉。\n      机制：Qwen 的 151K vocab tokenizer 与 Pythia/OLMo 的 50K vocab tokenizer\n      对同一文本产生不同的 subword 分割，导致 surprisal 统计量的 absolute values\n      和 distribution shape 系统性偏移。当 Qwen-cont 生成的文本被 Pythia 评分时，\n      Pythia 的 surprisal 分布反映的是 'Pythia 对 Qwen-style 文本的困惑度'，\n      而非 'depth 导致的 intrinsic quality degradation'。这个 confound 在 0v1\n      处不影响（human vs any-synthetic 的 surprisal gap 足够大），但在 1v2 处\n      将 depth signal 压缩到 θ 以下。\n\n      **K*=2 cells (12/16)**:\n      - Self-scorer (4): 无 confound，与已有结果一致。\n      - Same-family cross (Qwen-cont↔Qwen-base, 2 cells): 同架构不同 training，\n        tokenizer 相同，surprisal calibration 差异极小。\n      - Pythia↔OLMo cross (2 cells): 虽然是不同模型，但都继承自 GPT-2 style\n        架构，vocab size 接近（50257 vs 50304），tokenizer overlap 高，surprisal\n        统计量的 cross-model 偏移可控。\n      - Cross-family with Qwen-base as scorer for Pythia/OLMo (2 cells): Qwen-base\n        没有 instruction tuning 的 distribution shift，其 surprisal 估计对\n        continuation-mode 文本的 calibration 比 Qwen-Instruct 更好，1v2 AUC\n        勉强过线。\n      - Qwen-base gen scored by Pythia/OLMo (2 cells): Qwen-base 的 continuation\n        generation 产生的 text style 比 Qwen-Instruct 更 neutral，Pythia/OLMo\n        scorer 对其 depth signal 的捕获效率更高。\n\n      Feature ranking stability (mean ρ=0.91) 确认 exp_A 的发现：scorer choice\n      影响 absolute AUC 但不影响 which features matter。这意味着 scorer-dependence\n      是 calibration issue 而非 signal-type issue——depth degradation 的 feature\n      signature 是 scorer-independent 的，只是 magnitude 受 scorer-generator\n      alignment 调制。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"4×4 Cross-Scorer K* Matrix (1v2 AUC / K*)\"\n        columns: [\"Gen \\\\ Scorer\", Qwen-cont, Pythia, OLMo, Qwen-base]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen-cont\", \"0.611/K*=2\", \"0.598/K*=1\", \"0.592/K*=1\", \"0.609/K*=2\"]\n          - [\"Pythia\", \"0.593/K*=1\", \"0.654/K*=2\", \"0.639/K*=2\", \"0.610/K*=2\"]\n          - [\"OLMo\", \"0.586/K*=1\", \"0.630/K*=2\", \"0.615/K*=2\", \"0.603/K*=2\"]\n          - [\"Qwen-base\", \"0.622/K*=2\", \"0.608/K*=2\", \"0.601/K*=2\", \"0.626/K*=2\"]\n      - title: \"Scorer Independence: Feature Rank Correlation (Spearman ρ)\"\n        columns: [condition, rho, note]\n        rows:\n          - [\"self vs Pythia-scorer (avg)\", 0.923, \"high stability\"]\n          - [\"self vs OLMo-scorer (avg)\", 0.908, \"high stability\"]\n          - [\"self vs Qwen-base-scorer (avg)\", 0.941, \"highest (same tokenizer for Qwen-gen)\"]\n          - [\"cross-family min\", 0.867, \"Qwen-cont gen, OLMo scorer\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"K* matrix heatmap: 4×4 grid, 颜色编码 1v2 AUC (green >0.62, yellow 0.60-0.62, red <0.60)。Diagonal 全 green，cross-family cells 中 Qwen-Instruct-cont 相关的 4 个 cells 标红。清晰的 block-diagonal structure。\"\n      - \"Scorer impact scatter: 对每个 generator，4 个 scorer 条件的 1v2 AUC 用 jitter plot 展示。Pythia 和 OLMo 的 scatter 较窄（scorer 影响小），Qwen-cont 的 scatter 较宽（scorer 影响大）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-scorer matrix 确认 exp_A 的 scorer-dependence pattern 并完整量化其边界：\n      K*=1 严格限于 Qwen-Instruct-cont 与 Pythia/OLMo 的交叉配对（vocab mismatch +\n      instruction-tuning distribution shift 的叠加效应）。75% 的 cells K*=2 表明\n      scorer independence 在 majority conditions 下成立。论文中措辞：'K*=2 is\n      scorer-independent under same-family or similar-tokenizer conditions; cross-family\n      scoring with large tokenizer mismatch (50K vs 151K vocab) reduces K*_empirical\n      to 1, a calibration artifact rather than a signal absence.'\n\n      这一结果进一步 refine C1' 的 scope：universality claim 需额外条件 'with\n      matched or similar-family scorer'——这不是严重限制，因为实际部署中 scorer\n      selection 是可控参数。加入 Recommendation：'For cross-model depth estimation,\n      use a scorer from the same architecture family or with similar tokenizer;\n      alternatively, use the 9 non-surprisal features (frequency + diversity) for\n      fully scorer-independent estimation at the cost of ~2pp AUC reduction.'\n\n  - name: \"Retrain-chain ecological validity\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-008\"\n    description: >\n      Pythia-1.4B LoRA (rank=16, alpha=32), C4 5K docs, depth 0-4。对比 prompt-chain\n      和 retrain-chain 的 K* 和特征分布。P1 验证实验。\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9823\n        1v2: 0.6317\n        2v3: 0.5612\n        3v4: 0.5234\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0019\n        1v2: 0.0107\n        2v3: 0.0089\n        3v4: 0.0102\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        1v2: {ci_lower: 0.6198, ci_upper: 0.6436}\n        2v3: {ci_lower: 0.5503, ci_upper: 0.5721}\n      prompt_vs_retrain_comparison:\n        feature_kl_divergence: 0.147\n        degradation_ordering_spearman: 0.783\n        k_star_agreement: true\n        auc_1v2_delta: -0.0222\n        note: \"Retrain-chain 1v2 AUC lower than prompt-chain (0.632 vs 0.654) but K* identical\"\n      ordinal_mae: 1.127\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3734\n    result_rationale: >\n      Retrain-chain（真正的 model collapse pipeline）与 prompt-chain 的关键区别：\n      retrain-chain 中模型权重在每一代被更新，generation distribution 的变化\n      包含 weight drift + data distribution shift 两个因素，而 prompt-chain 只有\n      后者。在 median 档下：\n\n      K*=2 保持——两种 chain 类型的 depth-1 vs depth-2 区分都是 robust 的，因为\n      第一次 retrain 导致的 distributional shift 仍然足够大。但 1v2 AUC 比\n      prompt-chain 低约 2pp (0.632 vs 0.654)：retrain-chain 的 LoRA fine-tuning\n      使模型逐渐 adapt 到 synthetic data distribution，部分 compensate 了\n      quality degradation，导致 depth signal 被轻微压缩。\n\n      Feature distribution 差异（KL=0.147）主要来自 freq_entropy 和 ttr——\n      retrain-chain 中模型学会了 synthetic text 的 vocabulary usage pattern，\n      导致 diversity metrics 的 depth-dependent degradation 幅度减小。\n      但 surprisal-based features 受影响较小（因为 scorer 是 fixed Pythia-1.4B，\n      不是 retrained model），所以整体 K* 不变。\n\n      Degradation ordering Spearman=0.78 低于 cross-model continuation 的 ρ=0.85+，\n      因为 retrain-chain 引入了 model-adaptation-specific 的 feature 重排——\n      是 expected 的 partial divergence。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Prompt-chain vs Retrain-chain Comparison (Pythia-1.4B)\"\n        columns: [metric, prompt_chain, retrain_chain, delta]\n        rows:\n          - [K*, 2, 2, \"=\"]\n          - [1v2 AUC, 0.6539, 0.6317, -0.0222]\n          - [2v3 AUC, 0.5515, 0.5612, +0.0097]\n          - [ordinal accuracy, 0.383, 0.3734, -0.0096]\n          - [feature KL divergence, \"—\", 0.147, \"—\"]\n          - [degradation ordering ρ, \"—\", 0.783, \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side AUC decay curves: prompt-chain vs retrain-chain。两条曲线形状相似，retrain-chain 的 1v2 point 略低但 2v3 point 略高（retrain adaptation 使 depth 2-3 的差异被放大）。\"\n      - \"Feature distribution violin plots: 6 panel (top 6 features), 每 panel 2 violins (prompt vs retrain)。surp_d1_std 和 surp_std 分布接近，freq_entropy 和 ttr 分布明显偏移。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Retrain-chain ecological validity check 成功——K*=2 在更接近真实 model collapse\n      的 pipeline 中仍然成立。1v2 AUC 的 2pp 下降和 feature ordering 的 partial\n      divergence (ρ=0.78) 都在预期范围内，可以在 Discussion 中用于 caveating\n      prompt-chain 的 ecological validity：'The prompt-chain experimental setup\n      is a conservative proxy for real-world recursive contamination. Retrain-chain\n      validation shows K*=2 is preserved, with a modest 2pp reduction in 1v2 AUC\n      attributable to model adaptation effects.'\n\n  - name: \"Contamination dose-response\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-009\"\n    description: >\n      在 10%/30%/50% synthetic injection 比例下测试 graduated vs binary filtering 的收益差异。\n    expected_results:\n      injection_10pct:\n        binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5984\n        graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5979\n        delta: 0.0005\n        paired_p: 0.412\n        note: \"difference not significant at 10% injection\"\n      injection_30pct:\n        binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5961\n        graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5943\n        delta: 0.0018\n        paired_p: 0.087\n        note: \"marginally significant\"\n      injection_50pct:\n        binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5941\n        graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5892\n        delta: 0.0049\n        paired_p: 0.003\n        note: \"significant, matches exp-006 reference\"\n      dose_response_slope: \"~0.001pp binary advantage per 1% injection increase\"\n      no_filter_baseline:\n        injection_10pct: 0.5978\n        injection_30pct: 0.5932\n        injection_50pct: 0.5865\n    result_rationale: >\n      Dose-response 的 median 档预测逻辑：低注入比例下（10%），contaminated samples\n      对 training set 的影响有限，任何 filtering 策略都几乎等效于 no-filter——因为\n      90% clean data dominates training signal。Binary vs graduated 的差异被 clean\n      data 的 buffer effect 稀释。\n\n      随注入比例增加：(1) binary filtering 的 advantage 线性增长——它完整移除 K*\n      boundary 以上的 contaminated samples；(2) graduated filtering 的 soft weighting\n      保留了部分 contaminated samples（虽然降权），这些 residual contamination 在\n      高注入比例下累积效应更大；(3) 50% injection 复现 exp-006 结果。\n\n      Dose-response 斜率（~0.001pp/1%）意味着在真实世界的 5-15% contamination\n      rate 下，binary vs graduated 差异 <0.5pp MMLU——K*-aware binary filtering\n      的实际优势主要体现在高污染场景。论文中这一结果 nuance C3 claim：\n      binary filtering 是 universally optimal 但 marginal gain 依赖 contamination\n      severity。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Dose-Response: Binary vs Graduated Filtering MMLU\"\n        columns: [injection_rate, no_filter, binary_ours, graduated_a09, \"Δ(bin-grad)\", p_value]\n        rows:\n          - [\"10%\", 0.5978, 0.5984, 0.5979, +0.0005, 0.412]\n          - [\"30%\", 0.5932, 0.5961, 0.5943, +0.0018, 0.087]\n          - [\"50%\", 0.5865, 0.5941, 0.5892, +0.0049, 0.003]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dose-response line chart: x=injection rate, y=MMLU, 3 lines (no-filter, binary, graduated)。Binary 线始终最高，no-filter 线下降最快。三线在 10% 处几乎重合，50% 处 fan out。标注 significance brackets。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Dose-response 为 C3 提供 practical calibration：K*-aware binary filtering\n      在任何 contamination level 下都 ≥ graduated，但 marginal gain scales with\n      contamination severity。论文 Practical Implications 段可写：'At typical\n      estimated web contamination rates (10-20%), binary K*-aware filtering provides\n      modest but consistent improvement; at higher rates (≥30%), the advantage\n      becomes substantial.'\n\n  - name: \"Naturalistic validation on Common Crawl\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: >\n      对 Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot 样本做 depth 预测，与 AlignScore 和独立\n      vocabulary richness 指标做 correlation。P2 wild-data 验证。\n    expected_results:\n      n_samples: 50000\n      predicted_depth_distribution:\n        depth_0: 0.72\n        depth_1: 0.18\n        depth_2: 0.07\n        depth_3_plus: 0.03\n      correlation_with_alignscore:\n        spearman_rho: 0.341\n        p_value: \"<0.001\"\n        note: \"moderate positive correlation — higher predicted depth associates with lower AlignScore\"\n      correlation_with_vocab_richness:\n        ttr_spearman: 0.423\n        hapax_spearman: 0.389\n        note: \"predicted depth anti-correlates with diversity metrics as expected\"\n      calibration_note: \"no ground truth depth available; correlations are indirect validation\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Common Crawl naturalistic validation 是 inherently weak 的——没有 ground truth\n      depth labels，只能做 indirect correlation。Median 档预测：\n\n      Depth distribution 重度右偏（72% depth-0）反映 CC 中大部分文本仍是\n      human-authored。18% depth-1（单次 LLM 生成）是合理的 2025-2026 估计。\n      3% depth-3+ 对应 recursive pipeline outputs（chatbot chains, recursive\n      summarization outputs）。\n\n      AlignScore 相关性偏低（ρ=0.34）因为 AlignScore 衡量 factual consistency\n      而非 generational depth——depth-2 text 的事实性可能与 depth-1 无显著差异\n      （K*=2 的含义正是如此）。Vocabulary richness 相关性更高（ρ=0.42）因为\n      diversity compression 是 depth signal 的核心 component，与 15D features\n      直接相关。\n\n      这个实验的 median 结果只能作为 supporting evidence，不能进入 main claims。\n      论文 Appendix 定位为 'preliminary naturalistic application'。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Common Crawl 2025/2026 Depth Prediction Summary\"\n        columns: [metric, value]\n        rows:\n          - [n_samples, 50000]\n          - [predicted depth-0 fraction, 0.72]\n          - [predicted depth-1 fraction, 0.18]\n          - [predicted depth-2 fraction, 0.07]\n          - [predicted depth-3+ fraction, 0.03]\n          - [AlignScore correlation (ρ), 0.341]\n          - [TTR correlation (ρ), 0.423]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Predicted depth distribution histogram: heavy left skew, 72% depth-0。与 2024 CC snapshot 的 predicted distribution 做 overlay（如有）对比 temporal trend。\"\n      - \"Scatter plot: predicted depth vs AlignScore / TTR, 带 regression line。Moderate trend visible but high scatter。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Naturalistic validation 提供 face validity 但不能作为 strong evidence。\n      论文中定位为 Appendix 的 preliminary application，仅 claim 'predicted depth\n      distribution is consistent with expected contamination rates'。AlignScore\n      correlation 的 moderate 值实际上与 K*=2 一致——如果 depth>2 的区分力确实\n      消失，那么高 depth 文本的 quality metrics 就不应该 systematically worse\n      than depth-2。\n\n  - name: \"Domain ablation: Wikipedia seed data\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-023\"\n    description: >\n      Wikipedia seed data, Qwen2.5-1.5B (base) continuation mode, C4→Wikipedia 域迁移。\n      验证 K*=2 是否跨数据域一致。当前 orphaned。\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9912\n        1v2: 0.6067\n        2v3: 0.5534\n        3v4: 0.5278\n        4v5: 0.5098\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        1v2: {auc: 0.6067, ci_lower: 0.5961, ci_upper: 0.6173, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {auc: 0.5534, ci_lower: 0.5428, ci_upper: 0.5640, perm_p: 0.0001}\n      ordinal_mae: 1.189\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3651\n      feature_ranking_shift:\n        c4_vs_wikipedia_spearman: 0.821\n        shifted_feature: \"freq_entropy moves from rank 1 to rank 4; surp_d1_std becomes dominant\"\n        note: \"Wikipedia's more structured vocabulary reduces freq_entropy discriminative power\"\n      k_star_note: \"K*=2 but CI lower=0.5961 marginally below θ — borderline, may need classification as K*=1\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Wikipedia 与 C4 的关键差异：Wikipedia 文本更 structured（formal register,\n      encyclopedic style, consistent vocabulary usage），导致 freq_entropy 在\n      baseline (depth-0) 就较低且 variance 小——frequency-based features 的\n      discriminative headroom 被压缩。Depth signal 更依赖 surprisal-based features，\n      但 Wikipedia 的 formulaic structure 也使 surprisal 分布更 peaked。\n\n      K*=2 可能 borderline (CI lower ~0.596)——Wikipedia 的 structured nature 使\n      continuation-mode generation 更 constrained（模型倾向于延续 encyclopedic\n      style），successive generations 的 distributional shift 比 C4 更 subtle。\n      这是 domain-specific effect 而非 K*_theory 的变化——DPI 的 information loss\n      rate 对 Wikipedia 可能更低（structured text 有更高的 redundancy，information\n      loss per generation 更小），使 K*_theory 可能 >2 但 K*_empirical 在 features\n      的 sensitivity 边界上 wobble。\n\n      Orphaned status 意味着这个实验可能不会被完成，但如果完成，median 档预测\n      K*=2 with high uncertainty。论文中可以 omit 或放入 Appendix。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Domain Ablation: C4 vs Wikipedia (Qwen-base, continuation)\"\n        columns: [domain, 0v1_auc, 1v2_auc, 1v2_ci_lower, k_star, top_feature]\n        rows:\n          - [C4, 0.987, 0.626, 0.617, 2, freq_entropy]\n          - [Wikipedia, 0.991, 0.607, 0.596, \"2*\", surp_d1_std]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Domain comparison AUC decay: C4 vs Wikipedia，两条曲线在 0v1 几乎重合，1v2 处 Wikipedia 低约 2pp。θ 线标注，Wikipedia 1v2 error bar 跨越 θ。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain ablation（如果完成）会 further scope C1'——Wikipedia 的 borderline\n      result 提示 structured domains 可能需要 domain-adapted features 或更长文本\n      以达到可靠的 K*=2。论文中作为 limitation 提及：'K*=2 is demonstrated on\n      general web text (C4); highly structured domains such as Wikipedia may require\n      domain-specific feature calibration.' 但不影响 main claim，因为 C4 是\n      web contamination 的 primary target domain。\n\n  # Aggregate summary for paper narrative\n  aggregate_summary:\n    total_conditions_tested: 19\n    total_conditions_kstar2: 14\n    total_conditions_kstar1: 5\n    kstar2_conditions_list:\n      existing_10: \"Qwen-rw, Pythia-cont, OLMo-cont, Qwen-greedy, Qwen-nuc0.9, Qwen-T0.7, Qwen-T1.2, Qwen-7B, Qwen-base, Qwen-cont\"\n      new_4: \"LLaMA-8B, Pythia-greedy, Pythia-nuc0.9, Pythia-T1.2, length-256, length-512\"\n    kstar1_conditions_list:\n      - \"Mistral-7B (architecture-specific SWA smoothing)\"\n      - \"Pythia T=0.7 (borderline — low-temp diversity compression)\"\n      - \"128-token length (information insufficiency)\"\n      - \"exp-023 Wikipedia (borderline — domain-specific feature sensitivity)\"\n    cross_scorer_kstar2: \"12/16 = 75%\"\n    paper_headline_revision: >\n      From: 'K*=2 is invariant across all 10 tested conditions'\n      To: 'K*=2 is a robust discrimination boundary across 14/19 tested conditions\n      spanning 5 architecture families (1B-8B), 8 decoding configurations, base+instruct,\n      and 2 text lengths (≥256 tokens). The 5 boundary cases are principled:\n      3 reflect feature sensitivity limits (short text, low-temperature decoding,\n      architecture-specific attention mechanisms) consistent with DPI theory;\n      2 are scorer-alignment artifacts addressable by same-family scoring.'\n    c1_prime_final_wording: >\n      K*=2 is a robust discrimination boundary under standard conditions\n      (≥256 tokens; standard decoding temperature; self-scorer or same-family scorer),\n      invariant across 5 model architecture families at 1B-8B scale.\n    rebuttal_strategy:\n      reviewer_universality_attack: >\n        'We acknowledge K*=2 does not hold universally — it fails under 3 principled\n        boundary conditions (Section 4.x). These boundary cases are predicted by\n        DPI theory: K*_theory remains ≥2 in all cases, but K*_empirical depends\n        on feature sensitivity to residual mutual information. The 14/19 success rate\n        across deliberately diverse conditions (5 architectures, 8 decoding configs,\n        3 text lengths, 16 scorer combinations) demonstrates robustness, not\n        cherry-picked universality.'\n      reviewer_scale_attack: >\n        'LLaMA-3.1-8B confirms K*=2 (CI lower 0.606 > θ), extending coverage to 8B.\n        Mistral-7B K*=1 is explained by SWA-specific smoothing (Section 4.x),\n        not scale effects — at 7B Mistral is larger than our 4 confirmed ≤1.5B\n        models. DPI guarantees K*_theory exists for all model sizes; 13B+ validation\n        is important future work.'\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"605bf23b-1e59-4eaf-b1b1-77c0ed9853ff","total_cost_usd":1.148541,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":33208,"cache_read_input_tokens":56664,"output_tokens":35383,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":33208,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":35267,"cache_read_input_tokens":44823,"cache_creation_input_tokens":226,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":226},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":27939,"outputTokens":26,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.028069,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":3,"outputTokens":35383,"cacheReadInputTokens":56664,"cacheCreationInputTokens":33208,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.1204720000000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"8705d933-22cf-4afb-b47f-5b2314300b6f"}
